return ['domain'=>'zinn-chat','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-chat','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-02T17:56:55+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-02T17:56:55+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Chat'=>'Zinn® Chat','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat','A complete help desk and AI assistant that runs on your own WordPress: an AI that answers from your own pages with links, live chat, and support tickets in wp-admin, on a submit-a-ticket page and in the WooCommerce account area. Under 10 KB on the page and no requests at all until a visitor opens it.'=>'Kaalmeyn buuxa iyo caawiye sirdoon macmal ah (AI) oo ka shaqeeya WordPress-kaaga: AI ka jawaaba bogaggaaga oo wata xiriiriyo, wada-sheekaysi toos ah, iyo tigidhada taageerada ee wp-admin, bogga soo gudbinta tigidhka iyo aagga xisaabta WooCommerce. Ka yar 10 KB bogga mana jiraan wax codsiyo ah ilaa booqde uu furo.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Inbox'=>'Sanduuqa fariimaha','Tickets'=>'Tikidhada','Assistant'=>'Caawiye','Settings'=>'Dejinta','Setup'=>'Habayn','Zinn® Chat could not create its database tables:'=>'Zinn® Chat ma awoodin inay abuurto miisaska keydkeeda xogta:','The AI assistant could not answer a visitor:'=>'Kaaliyaha AI wuu awood waayay inuu ka jawaabo booqde:','Fix it'=>'Hagaaji','Loading…'=>'Soo raraya…','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Shaaddadani waxay u baahan tahay JavaScript.','Chat'=>'Sheeko','AI assistant'=>'Kaaliyaha AI','Tickets and email'=>'Tikidhada iyo iimaylka','Site index'=>'Tusaha bogagga','Privacy and spam'=>'Sirxdoonka iyo spam-ka','Connect to Zinn Digital®'=>'Ku xidhnow Zinn Digital®','AI agents (MCP)'=>'Wakiillada AI (MCP)','Show the chat on the site'=>'Kusi muuqaalka sheekaysiga ee bogga','Nothing appears on the site, and nothing is loaded, until this is ticked.'=>'Waxba kama muuqdo goobta, waxbana lama soo dejiyo, ilaa tan laga calaamadiyo.','Chat title'=>'Wadahadalka cinwaankiisa','Greeting'=>'Salaan','The first thing a visitor sees.'=>'Waxa ugu horreeya ee booqdahaagu arko.','Greeting when nobody can answer'=>'Salaan marka aysan jirin qof ka jawaabi kara','Colour'=>'Midab','Text colour on the colour'=>'Midabka qoraalka ee midabka','Position'=>'Booska','Bottom, end side (right in left-to-right languages)'=>'Hoose, dhinaca dhammaadka (midig ee luqadaha bidix-ilaa-midig)','Bottom, start side'=>'Hoose, dhinaca billowga','Offer "Talk to a person"'=>'Dalbo "La hadol qof"','Shown while somebody has the Inbox open and is not set to away.'=>'Waxay muuqataa inta qofku uu Sanduuqa Boostada furay oo aan loo dhigin inuu maqan yahay.','Hide the chat from your support team while they are signed in'=>'Ka qari sheekada kooxdaada taageerada inta ay soo galeen','Show "Powered by Zinn® Chat" under the chat'=>'Muuji "Powered by Zinn® Chat" oo hoos yimaada wadahadalka','Optional. Off unless you turn it on.'=>'Ikhtiyaari ah. Waa dansan yahay ilaa aad ka shiddo.','Let the AI assistant answer visitors'=>'U ogolow kaaliyaha AI inuu ka jawaabo booqdayaasha','Assistant name'=>'Magaca kaaliyaha','Extra instructions for the assistant'=>'Tilmaamo dheeri ah oo loogu talagalay kaaliyaha','For example: "Always mention our 30-day returns." They cannot override the safety rules.'=>'Tusaale ahaan: "Had iyo jeer xus soo-celinahayaga 30-ka maalmood ah." Ma tirtiri karaan xeerarka badbaadada.','Answer language'=>'Luuqadda jawaabta','"auto" answers in the visitor\'s own language; or a locale such as en_GB or de_DE to always answer in one language.'=>'"auto" waxay ku jawaabaysaa luqadda booqdaha; ama goob sida en_GB ama de_DE si loo isticmaalo hal luqad mar walba.','Minimum relevance'=>'Ugu yaraan khuseeya','Passages scoring below this (0 to 0.95) are not used, and the assistant says it does not know. Check scores in the test console.'=>'Qeybaha buundooyinkoodu ka hooseeyaan tan (0 ilaa 0.95) lama isticmaalo, waxaana kaaliyuhu sheegayaa inuusan aqoon. Ka eeg buundooyinka konsole-ka tijaabada.','Offer a person after this many unanswered questions'=>'U soo jeedi qof ka dib tiradan su\'aalaha aan la jawaabin','Longest answer (tokens)'=>'Jawaabta ugu dheer (summadaha)','Accept support tickets'=>'Ogolow tigidhada taageerada','Support page'=>'Bogga taageerada','The page with the [zinn_chat_support] shortcode or the Support page block. Ticket links in emails open this page.'=>'Bogga wata [zinn_chat_support] shortcode ama Support page block. Xiriirinta tigidhada ee iimeelada ayaa furaysa boggan.','Send team alerts to'=>'U dir digniinaha kooxda ku socota','One or more email addresses, separated by commas. Empty: the site admin email.'=>'Hal ama in ka badan cinwaan iimeyl, oo ay kala soocayaan faqrado. Madhan: iimeylka maamulaha bogga.','Sender name on emails'=>'Magaca soo-diraha ee iimayllada','Email the team when a visitor waits for a person longer than (minutes)'=>'U dir iimayl kooxda marka booqdahu uu qof sugayo in ka badan (daqiiqado)','Private ticket links work for (days after the last message)'=>'Xiriiriyeyaasha tikidhada gaarka ah waxay shaqeeyaan (maalmo kadib fariintii ugu dambeysay)','After that the page offers to email a new link.'=>'Intaa ka dib boggu wuxuu soo jeedinayaa inuu iimayl ku soo diro xiriiriye cusub.','Add a Support tab to the WooCommerce account area'=>'Ku dar tabka Taageero qaybta koontada WooCommerce','Let the assistant tell signed-in customers about their own orders'=>'U oggolow caawiyaha inuu macaamiisha soo gashay ugu warramo dalabaadkooda','Answers "where is my order?" from the order status and tracking.'=>'Waxay ka jawaabaysaa "xaggee ayay dalabkaygu joogaa?" xaaladda dalabka iyo raadraaca.','Content the assistant reads'=>'Nuxurka uu akhristaha akhriyo','None ticked means every public type.'=>'Midna lagama dooran waxay ka dhigan tahay dhammaan noocyada dadweynaha.','WooCommerce products, prices, stock, shipping and payment methods'=>'Alaabta WooCommerce, qiimaha, alaabta kaydka taal, rarista iyo hababka lacag-bixinta','Forums (bbPress, BuddyBoss, wpForo)'=>'Goobaha doodda (bbPress, BuddyBoss, wpForo)','Read pages as visitors see them when a page builder\'s content cannot be read directly'=>'Akhri bogollada sida ay soo-booqdayashu u arkaan marka aan si toos ah loo akhrin karin waxa ku jira dhisaha bogga','Fetches the page from your own site in the background.'=>'Wuxuu bogga ka soo qaadayaa boggaaga dambe.','Never read these posts or pages (IDs)'=>'Weligi ha akhrisan qoraalladan ama bogaggan (IDs)','Comma-separated.'=>'Comma-separated.','Ask visitors to agree before a chat or ticket'=>'Weydii booqdayaasha inay oggolaadaan ka hor inta aan la bilaabin sheeko ama tigidh','Agreement text'=>'Qoraalka heshiiska','Privacy policy link'=>'Xiriirinta siyaasadda asturnaanta','Empty: the site\'s privacy policy page.'=>'Madhan: bogga siyaasadda khaaska ah ee barta.','Delete finished chats and tickets after (days)'=>'Tirtir wadahadallada iyo tikidhada dhammaaday kadib (maalmo)','0 keeps them.'=>'0 ayaa haya.','Store visitors\' IP addresses'=>'Kaydi cinwaanada IP-ga ee booqdayaasha','Off: only a coded form is kept, enough for spam limits.'=>'Damiinsan: kaliya foom calaamadaysan ayaa la hayaa, oo ku filan xadka spam-ka.','Messages per visitor per hour'=>'Fariimaha booqadahakiiba saacadkii','Chats per visitor per day'=>'Wadahadallada booqashadiiba maalintii','Tickets per visitor per day'=>'Tigidhada booqadaha kasta maalintiiba','Longest chat message (characters)'=>'Farriinta chat-ka ugu dheer (xarfaha)','Block list'=>'Liiska xayiraadda','One per line: an IP address, an email address, @domain.com, or a word.'=>'Midkiiba sadarkii: Cinwaanka IP, cinwaanka iimaylka, @domain.com, ama eray.','Where chats are answered'=>'Halkta wadahadalada lagaga jawaabo','"This site" keeps everything in this site\'s database and uses your own AI key. "Zinn Digital®" uses the hosted inbox in the Zinn® app (for Zinn® hosting customers).'=>'"Goobtan" waxay wax walba ku haysaa database-ka goobtan waxayna isticmaashaa furahaaga AI. "Zinn Digital®" waxay isticmaashaa sanduuqa fariimaha ee la martigeliyay ee abka Zinn® (ee loogu talagalay macaamiisha martigelinta ee Zinn®).','This site (recommended)'=>'Goobtan (lagu taliyay)','Zinn Digital® app'=>'Barnaamijka Zinn Digital®','Zinn® widget key'=>'Zinn® widget key','From the Zinn® app: Live chat, then your widget. Starts with zc_.'=>'Laga bilaabo abka Zinn®: Wada sheekaysiga tooska ah, ka dibna qalabkaaga (widget). Waxay ka bilaabataa zc_.','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'Oggolow wakiilada AI (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'Damiyey: qalabka hoose iyo waddooyinkooda REST midna gabi ahaanba ma diiwaangashana.','Zinn® Chat settings'=>'Dejinta Zinn® Chat','Settings saved.'=>'Dejinta waa la keydiyay.','The assistant uses your own AI key.'=>'Kaaliyuhu wuxuu isticmaalaa furahaaga AI ee gaarka ah.','AI providers and models'=>'Bixiyeyaasha iyo moodooyinka AI','— None —'=>'— Midna —','Saved — leave empty to keep'=>'La kaydiyey - banaan uga tag si aad u ilaaliso','Remove the saved key'=>'Ka saar furaha la keydiyay','You are not allowed to change these settings.'=>'Lama ogola in aad beddesho dejiintan.','Turn the chat on'=>'Shid sheekaysiga','The chat is showing on your site.'=>'Wadahadalku wuxuu ka muuqdaa boggaaga.','Nothing is shown or loaded on your site until you turn it on.'=>'Waxba laguma tuso ama looma soo geliyo boggaaga ilaa aad ka shaqsiiso.','Turn off'=>'Demi','Turn on'=>'Shid','Connect your AI provider'=>'Ku xidh bixiyahaaga AI','Connected. Site search uses %1$s (%2$s).'=>'Isku xidhan. Raadinta goobtu waxay isticmaashaa %1$s (%2$s).','Connected. Your provider cannot build a meaning-based index, so the assistant uses keyword search. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key for better answers.'=>'Ku xidhan. Bixiyahaagu ma dhisi karo tusmo macnaha ku salaysan, markaa caawiyuhu wuxuu isticmaalaa raadinta erayada muhiimka ah. Ku dar furaha Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ama OpenRouter si aad u hesho jawaabo ka fiican.','Add a key for Google Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Mistral, OpenRouter or any OpenAI-compatible service. The newest model is chosen for you; you can change it.'=>'Ku dar furaha Google Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Mistral, OpenRouter ama adeeg kasta oo OpenAI ku habboon. Model-ka ugu cusub ayaa adiga laguu doorayaa; waad beddeli kartaa.','AI providers'=>'Bixiyeyaasha AI','Let the assistant read your site'=>'U oggolow kaaliyaha inuu akhriyo boggaaga','%1$d pages read, %2$d waiting, %3$d passages. New and edited content is picked up automatically.'=>'%1$d bogag la akhriyay, %2$d ayaa sugaya, %3$d qaybood. Waxyaabaha cusub iyo kuwa la tafatiray si otomaatig ah ayaa loo soo qaadaa.','Read the whole site now'=>'Hadda akhri boga oo dhan','Create your support page'=>'Abuur bogaggaaga taageerada','Visitors submit tickets there, and ticket emails link to it.'=>'Booqdayeyaashu waxay halkaas ka soo gudbiyaan tigidhada, iimaylada tigidhada ayaana ku xidhan.','A page with the ticket form, where customers also follow their requests.'=>'Bog ay ku yaal foomka tigidhka, halkaas oo macaamiishu sidoo kale ay kala socdaan codsiyadooda.','View'=>'Eeg','Create the support page'=>'Abuur bogagga taageerada','Add "Submit a ticket" and "Chat with us" to a menu'=>'Ku dar "Gudbi tigidh" iyo "Nagala hadal" liiska xulashada','Appearance, Menus: use the Zinn® Chat box. Or add the Zinn® Chat blocks to any page, in any page builder.'=>'Muuqaalka, Menu-yada: isticmaal sanduuqa Zinn® Chat. Ama ku dar baloogyada Zinn® Chat bog kasta, nooc kasta oo dhise bog ah.','Menus'=>'Liisaska','WooCommerce account area'=>'Aagga koontada WooCommerce','Customers see their tickets under Support in My Account, and the assistant can tell them where their order is.'=>'Macmiilayaasha waxay tigidhadooda ku arkaan Taageero hoos timaada Koontadayda, kaaliyuhuna wuxuu u sheegi karaa halka uu dalabkoodu jiro.','Test the assistant'=>'Tijaabi kaaliyaha','Ask it questions and see exactly which pages it answered from, including out-of-date ones.'=>'Weydii su\'aalo oo si sax ah u arag bogagga ay kaga jawaabtay, oo ay ku jiraan kuwa duugowday.','Open the test console'=>'Fur konsolka tijaabada','Answer live chats'=>'Ka jawaab wadahadalada tooska ah','Visitors can ask for a person while you have the Inbox open. It works on a phone too.'=>'Booqasho-bixiyeyaashu waxay codsan karaan qof markii aad Inbox-ka furno tahay. Waxay sidoo kale ka shaqeysaa taleefanka.','Open the Inbox'=>'Fur Sanduuqa Boostada','Set up Zinn® Chat'=>'Deji Zinn® Chat','This site is connected to the Zinn Digital® app: chats are answered there. To run the help desk on this site instead, choose "This site" under Settings, Connect to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Boggan waxa uu ku xiran yahay abka Zinn Digital®: wada-sheekaysiyada halkaas ayaa lagaga jawaabaa. Si aad halkii loogu talagalay caawinta uga shaqeysiiso boggan, dooro "Boggan" oo hoos taga Settings, Connect to Zinn Digital®.','You are not allowed to do that.'=>'Looma oggola inaad taas samayso.','Unlimited agents, with a Support agent role that sees only chats and tickets'=>'Wakiillo aan xadidnayn, oo leh door wakiil taageero ah oo arka kaliya sheekooyinka iyo tigidhada','Reply to tickets by email'=>'Kaga jawaab tigidhada iimaylka','Knowledge base: articles, categories, search, and a KB section in the chat'=>'Saldhiga aqoonta: qoraallo, qaybo, raadin, iyo qayb KB ah oo ku jirta sheekaysiga','Saved replies, business hours, priorities and SLAs'=>'Jawaabaha la keydiyey, saacadaha shaqada, mudnaanta iyo SLAs','Suggested replies, thread summaries and auto-tagging by AI'=>'Jawaabaha lagula taliyay, soo koobidaha dunta iyo calaamadaynta tooska ah ee AI','Knowledge-gap report: the questions your site could not answer'=>'Warbixinta farqiga aqoonta: su\'aalaha ay boggaagu ka jawaabi kari wayday','Push notifications and an installable agent app for your phone'=>'Ogeysiisyada riixitaanka iyo barnaamij wakiil oo la rakibi karo oo loogu talagalay teleefankaaga','Proactive messages, reports, webhooks, Slack and Telegram alerts'=>'Fariimaha kahortagga ah, Warbixinnada, Webhook-yada, Digniinaha Slack iyo Telegram','Zinn® Chat Pro'=>'Zinn® Chat Pro','From $%1$d a month or $%2$d a year for one site.'=>'Laga bilaabo $%1$d bishii ama $%2$d sannadkii hal goob.','Try Pro free for 14 days'=>'Isku day Pro lacag la\'aan 14 cisho','See plans'=>'Eeg qorshayaasha','No card needed for the trial.'=>'Tijaabada looma baahna kaar.','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Sameeyayaasha ChatGPT. Qalab guud oo wanaagsan.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Sameeyayaasha Claude. Ku xooggan qorista iyo sababaynta taxaddarka leh.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Noocyada Gemini ee Google. Degdeg ah oo jaban.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Shirkad AI oo Yurub ah oo leh moodallo degdeg ah, jaban.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Qaabab jaban oo ku fiican qorista iyo koodhka.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Hal furaha ee moodooyinka laga keenayo bixiyeyaal badan oo kala duwan.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Adeeg kasta oo u shaqeeya sida OpenAI\'s API, oo ay ku jirto qaab ay ku shaqeyneyso kombiyuutarkaaga ama adeegahaaga.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Guud ahaan (la isticmaalo marka aan wax gaar ah la cayimin)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Qorista iyo dib-u-qorista','Translation'=>'Turjumaad','Code and CSS'=>'Koodhka iyo CSS-ka','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Waan ka xunnahay, looma oggola inaad gasho boggan.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Goobahan waxaa wadaagaya dhammaan qalabka dheeraadka ah ee isticmaala: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Furayaashaada waxaa lagu farsameeyay xog-ururinta boggan waxaana loo diraa oo keliya bixiyaha aad dooratay - weligood nooma soo diraan.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Tallaabada 1 ee 2: dooro bixiye AI ah','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Waxaad keenaysaa furahaaga gaarka ah, markaa waxaad si toos ah uga bixisaa bixiyaha wixii aad isticmaasho. Ma hubtid? Mid kasta oo ka mid ah kuwan ayaa si fiican u shaqeeya; waxaad ku dari kartaa kuwo kale markii dambe.','Next'=>'Xiga','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Tallaabada 2 ee 2: ku xidh %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Geli cinwaanka adeeggaaga OpenAI-waafaqsan, kaas oo ku dhammaada /v1. Furaha waxa kaliya oo loo baahan yahay haddii adeeggu uu dalbado mid.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Fur %s oo lagalay (ama abuur akoon bilaash ah).','the %s API keys page'=>'bogga %s fayaalal API','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Abuur furaha cusub oo koobi garee.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Halkan ku dheji oo riix "Keydi oo tijaabi". Waxaan direynaa hal codsi oo yar si loo hubiyo inuu shaqeynayo.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Badaleeyaasha badankood waxay u baahan yihiin xoogaa deyn ah oo ku jirta akoonka ka hor inta uusan furaha shaqeyn: %s.','add credit'=>'ku dar deyn','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Dooro bixiye kale','Address'=>'Ciwaan','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Furaha la key oo la keydiyay wuxuu ku dhamaanayaa …%s — dhejiso mid cusub si aad ugu beddesho','Key (optional)'=>'Furaha (ikhtiyaari)','API key'=>'Furaha API','Save and test'=>'Kaydi oo tamiuji','Providers'=>'Bixiyeyaasha','Provider'=>'Bixiyaha','Status'=>'Xaaladda','Key'=>'Furaha','Get a key'=>'Hel furaha','Test'=>'Imtixaan','Remove'=>'Ka saar','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Nooca cusub ee qalab-kordhinta ayaa badbaadiyey: cusbooneysii qalab-kordhintakan, ama geli furaha mar labaad.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Furaha la keydiyay lama furan karo simba (furaha amniga ee boggu waa is beddelay). Geli mar kale.','Not connected'=>'Lama xiriirin','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Ku xiran — imtixaankii ugu dambeeyay wuu gudbay %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Imtixaankii ugu dambeeyay wuu guuldarraystay: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Ku xidhan — wali lama tijaabin','Which model to use'=>'Waa maxay moodeelka la isticmaalayo','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ waxay calaamad u tahay taladayada hawshaas. Liisku waxa uu ka kooban yahay nooc kasta oo furahaagu isticmaali karo, oo si toos ah looga aqriyay bixiyaha.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— Waxaa lagu talinayaa bixiyaha —','Save models'=>'Kaydiso moodellada','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Ka cusboonaysii liiska moodalka bixiyeyaasha','Images'=>'Sawirrada','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Ku xidh OpenAI ama Google Gemini si aad sawiro u samayso.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Qaabka sawirka ee ugu dambeeyay ee bixiyaha ugu horreeya ee xiran —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Raadinta goobta (ku-xiridda)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'Ku xidh Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ama OpenRouter si aad u dhisto tusmada raadinta ee mareegtaada.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Qaabka laba-gelinta ee ugu dambeeyay ee bixiyaha ugu horreeya ee xidhan —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Beddelidda tani waxay dib u dhisaysaa tusmada raadinta ee kasta oo ah plugin-ka isticmaala.','best quality'=>'tayada ugu fiican','lowest cost'=>'qiimaha ugu hooseeya','fastest'=>'ugarsan','Add a model yourself'=>'Naftaada ku dar qaab','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Model cusub ayaa soo baxay maanta? Geli magaciisa saxda ah si aad isla markiiba u isticmaasho.','Model name'=>'Magaca qaabka','Add model'=>'Ku dar nooca','Recommended models list'=>'Liiska moodellada lagu talinayo','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Liiska moodillada lagu taliyay lama xaqiijin karo, markaa lama soo bandhigi doono talooyin. Dib u rakib furaha (plugin-ka), ama shid cusboonaysiinta maalinlaha ah ee hoose.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Liiska la isticmaalayo waxaa la daabacay %s. Cusboonaysiin kasta oo plugin ah waxay keenaysaa mid cusub.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Sidoo kale, eeg Zinn Digital® hal mar maalintii si aad u hesho liis cusboonaysiiyey.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Kaliya codsi dejisan oo fudud ayaa la dirayaa: ma jiro furaha, ciwaanka goobta, ama wax ku saabsan nuxurkaaga. Liiska waa la saxiixay, liiska ku guuldareysta hubinta saxiixana waa la iska indhatirayaa.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Markii ugu dambeysay ee la hubiyay %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Keydi, oo hadda hubi haddii la shiday','a newer list was installed'=>'liis cusub ayaa la rakibay','already up to date'=>'hore u cusbooneysay','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'soo dejintu waa ay ku guuldareysatay hubinta saxiixa waxaana la iska indhatiray','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Zinn Digital® lama gaari karo; liiska hadda jira waa in la isticmaalo','turned off'=>'demiyay','Open'=>'Furo','Check their status page'=>'Eeg boggoodooda xaaladda','Open your billing page'=>'Fur boggaaga biilasha','Open your API keys page'=>'Fur bogta furayaashaaga API','Open the AI settings'=>'Fur dejinta AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Waan ka xumahay, looma oggola inaad taas sameyso.','Unknown provider.'=>'Bixiye aan la aqoon.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Geli cinwaanka adeegaga, tusaale ahaan http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Taasi uma eka furaha API. Nuqul ka yeeg mar labaad, adigoo aan lahayn bannaan.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Marka hore dhejiso furahaaga API.','Key removed.'=>'Furaha waa la saaray.','Models saved.'=>'Qaababka waa la keydiyay.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Geli magaca saxda ah ee moodalka, tusaale ahaan sida dukumentiyada bixiyaha ay u qoraan.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'La daray %s. Ka dooro hoosta "Nooca la isticmaalayo".','Model removed.'=>'Nooca waa la saaray.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Cusboonaysiinada maalinlaha ah waa dansan yihiin. Liiska la socda hordhaca (plugin) waa la isticmaalayaa.','Checked: %s.'=>'La hubiyay: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'Liisaska moodalka waa la cusboonaysiiyay.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Furahaaga AI waxaa kaydiyay nooc cusub oo ka mid ah lifaaqyadaada (plugins). Cusboonaysii lifaaqan, ama mar kale geli furaha goobaha AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Furahaaga AI ee la keydiyay dib looma furan karo (furayaasha amniga ee boggu waa is beddeleen). Dib u geli dejinta AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI-ga lama dejinin weligiis. Ku dar furaha bixiyaha AI-ga goobaha AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Hawushan ma leh qaab la doortay. Mid ka dooro dejinta AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Bixiyaha AI-gaas laguma taageero noocaan ah ee qalab-kordhinta (plugin).','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Ma jiro wax bixiye AI ah oo abuuri kara sawirro oo ku xiran. Ku dar furaha OpenAI ama Google Gemini goobaha AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Bixiyaha AI-gan ma sameyn karo sawirro. Dooro OpenAI ama Google Gemini sawirrada ku jira dejinta AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Furahaaga AI ma isticmaali karo wax nooca sawir ah ah. Ka hubi rukhsadaha furaha bixiyaha, ama dooro bixiye kale oo sawirada ah.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Ma jiro bixiye AI ah oo ku xiran oo dhisli kara tusmada raadinta. Ku dar furaha Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ama OpenRouter goobaha AI.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Furahaaga AI ma isticmaali karo nooc kasta oo embedding ah. Ka hubi rukhsadaha furaha bixiyaha, ama dooro bixiye kale si aad u baarto mareegta.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Adeeg bixiyahan AI ma dhisi karo tusmada raadinta. Ku xidh Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ama adeeg ku habboon raadinta bogga.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Boggan ma gaari karo adeeggaaga AI. Hubi inuu shaqaynayo iyo in cinwaankiisa laga gaari karo server-kaaga shabakadda (adeeg ka dhex jira kombiyuutarkaaga lagama gaari karo bog lagu martigeliyay).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Goobtankani ma gaari karo %s. Ka hubi boggooda xaaladda; haddii ay shaqeynayaan, waxaa laga yaabaa in martigeliyahaagu xirayo xiriirada baxaya, ama cinwaanku waa khalad.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s waxay sheegaysaa in koontadaadu ay ka dhammaatay credit ama koota. Ku dar credit ama kor u qaad xadkaaga koontadaada halkooda, dabadeedna dib u day.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s maysan aqbalin furahaaga. Waxaa laga yaabaa in si khaldan loo qoray, la baabi\'iyay ama uu dhacay. Abuur fure cusub oo ku dheji halkan.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s wuxuu diiday codsigan furahaaga. Furaha waxaa laga yaabaa inuusan geli karin moodeelkan ama muuqaalkan, ama koontadaadu waxay u baahan tahay xaqiijin.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Qaabka "%1$s" waxaa laga heli karo %2$s furehaaga. Dooro qaab kale oo ka mid ah dejinta AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Qorshahaaga %2$s kuma jiro tusaalaha "%1$s". Ka dooro tusaale kale oo ku jira dejinta AI, ama kor ugu qaad qorshahaaga iyaga.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s waxay xaddidaysaa inta uu furahaagu si dhakhso ah u diri karo codsiyada. Sug daqiiqad oo dib u day, ama kor u qaad xadkaaga sicirka iyaga.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s wuxuu la kulmayaa dhibaatooyin hadda (cillad ama culays xad-dhaaf ah oo dhinaciisa ah). Wax khaldan oo ka jira habayntaada ma jiraan. Mar kale isku day wax yar ka dib.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Codsiga AI wuu fashilmay sabab aanan garan karin. Isku day mar kale; haddii ay sii dhacdo, la xiriir taageerada oo u dir macluumaadka hoose.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Bixiyaha AI-ga wuxuu ku jawaabay qaab uusan fiiriyahan akhrisan karin. Mar kale isku day; haddii ay sii socoto, dooro qaab kale ama la xiriir taageerada.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Caadiga ah (La jaanqaada OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Markha horta furaha bixiyahan.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Furahaagu wuu shaqeynayaa, laakiin bixiyuhu ma liis-gareynayo qaab qoraal ah (text model) oo loogu talagalay. Ku dar qaab adigu hoos.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Isku xiran. %1$s wuxuu ka jawaabay isagoo adeegsanaya %2$s. Astaamahaaga AI waa diyaar in la isticmaalo.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Dooxadaada adeegsadaha looma oggola inay isticmaasho AI goobtan. Weydiiso maamule.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Webkaan wuxuu gaaray xadka bisha ee kharashka AI. Maamulaha ayaa ku kordhin kara dejinta AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Boggani wuxuu gaaray xadka bisha ee codsisyada AI. Maamulaha ayaa kor u qaadi kara goobaha AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Isticmaalka iyo kharashka','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Diiwaanka, xadka iyo ogolaanshaha doorka waxaa lagu dabaqaa sirdoonka macmalka (AI) ee lagu isticmaalo: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Kharashku waa qiyaas, waxaana laga xisaabiyay qiimaha la daabacay; qaab aan la aqoon qiimihiisu wuxuu u tirsamayaa eber.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Bishan: %1$s codsiyo, ku dhawaad %2$s.','When'=>'Markaan','Who'=>'Kuma','Used for'=>'Loo isticmaalay','Model'=>'Nooca','Tokens in / out'=>'Calaamadaha / Soo baxay','About'=>'Ku saabsan','Result'=>'Natiijo','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Weli lama samayn wax codsiyo ah oo ku saabsan AI.','Done'=>'La dhammeeyey','Limits and permissions'=>'Xadka iyo ogolaanshaha','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Xadka kharashka bisha (US dollars)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'U daa faaruq haddii aan xad la rabin. AI waxay istaagaysaa inta ka dhiman bisha marka qiimaha qiyaasiga ahi uu gaaro halkaas.','Monthly request limit'=>'Xadka codsiga bishii','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Haddii aanad rabin xad, banow.','Who may use AI'=>'Yaa isticmaali kara AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Guji midna si aad u ogolaato qof kasta oo isticmaali kara sifooyinka plugin-ka inuu isticmaalo AI. Maamulayaashu waxay isticmaali karaan mar walba.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Keydso xadka iyo ogolaanshaha','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Xaddidyada iyo fasaxyada waa la keydiyay.','Content'=>'Nuxurka','Not found.'=>'Lama helin.','%s joined the chat.'=>'%s wuxuu ku biiray wada-sheekaysiga.','Type a reply first.'=>'Markuu hore jawaab qor.','The chat has ended. Thank you for contacting us.'=>'Sheekadu waa dhammaatay. Waad ku mahadsan tahay inaad nala soo xiriirtay.','You are chatting with the assistant again.'=>'Waxaad dib ula hadlaysaa caawiyaha.','This conversation is now ticket #%d. We will reply by email.'=>'Wadahadalkani hadda waa tigidh #%d. Waxaan kuugu soo jawaabi doonaa iimeyl ahaan.','Type a question first.'=>'Markaad hore u qorto su\'aal.','The whole site is being read again in the background.'=>'Goobta oo dhan ayaa dib looga akhrinayaa dhinaca dambe.','Meanings are being rebuilt in the background.'=>'Macnayaasha ayaa dib looga dhisayaa xagga dambe.','Submit a ticket form'=>'Gudbi foomka tigidhada','Heading'=>'Madax-qoraal','Default subject'=>'Mudane caadi ah','Button text'=>'Qoraalka badhanka','Show the subject field (yes or no)'=>'Muuji goobta mawduuca (haa ama maya)','My support requests'=>'Codsashadayda taageerada','Chat button'=>'Badhanka sheekada','Chat with us'=>'Nala sheekayso','Support'=>'Taageero','Thank you. Your request is ticket #%d. We have emailed you a link to follow it.'=>'Mahadsanid. Codsigaagu waa tigidh #%d. Waxaanu kuu soo dirnay iimeyl ay ku qoran tahay xiriiriye aad kula socon karto.','Your reply has been sent.'=>'Jawaabtaadi waa la diray.','If there is a request under that address, we have emailed you a new link.'=>'Haddii ay jirto codsi hoos imaanaya cinwaankaas, waxaanu ku soo dirnay iimeyl xiriirin cusub.','Something went wrong. Please check the form and try again.'=>'Wax bay khaldantay. Fadlan hubi foomka oo dib u day.','Your message could not be sent.'=>'Farriintaadii lama diri karin.','You are sending messages too quickly. Please wait a little and try again.'=>'Waxaad diraysaa fariimo si aad u dheereysa. Fadlan in yar sug oo dib u day.','Please agree to the privacy notice to send your request.'=>'Fadlan oggolow ogeysiiska sirta si aad codsigaaga u dirto.','Please complete the check to show you are not a robot.'=>'Fadlan dhameystir baaritaanka si aad u muujiso inaad aadan ahayn robot.','Sign in to see your support requests.'=>'So gal si aad u aragto codsiyadaada taageerada.','Your name'=>'Magacaaga','Your email'=>'Email-kaaga','Subject'=>'Mowduuc','Which order is this about?'=>'Dalabkan noocee ah ayuu khuseeyaa?','Not about an order'=>'Dalab kuma saabsana','How can we help?'=>'Sidekee intee ku caawinnaa?','Privacy policy'=>'Politika asturnaanta','Send request'=>'Dir codsi','All requests'=>'Dhammaan codsiyada','Your support requests'=>'Codsashadaada taageerada','You have no support requests yet.'=>'Ma haystaan ​​wax codsiyo taageero ah ilaa hadda.','Updated'=>'La cusboonaysiiyay','New request'=>'Codsi cusub','This link has expired. Enter your email address and we will send you a new one.'=>'Xiriirnikani wuu dhacay. Geli iimaylkaaga waxaanuna kuu soo diri doonaa mid cusub.','This link is not valid. Enter your email address and we will send you a link to your requests.'=>'Xiriirintani ma shaqaynayso. Geli ciwaankaaga iimaylka waxaanu kuu soo diri doonaa xiriiri ku socda codsiyadaada.','Email me a new link'=>'Ii soo dir xiriir cusub oo iimayl ah','Request #%1$d: %2$s'=>'Codsiga #%1$d: %2$s','Status:'=>'Xaaladda:','Your reply'=>'Jawaabtaada','Send reply'=>'Dir jawaabta','You'=>'Adiga','Submit a ticket'=>'Gudbi tigidh','Add to Menu'=>'Ku dar Liiska','Create the support page on the Zinn® Chat setup screen to add a "Submit a ticket" link.'=>'Abuur bogga taageero ee shaashadda dejinta Zinn® Chat si aad ugu darto xiriiriyaha "Gudbi tigidh".','[#%1$d] We have your request: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Waxaan haynaa codsigaaga: %2$s','Thank you for contacting us. We have received your request and will reply as soon as we can.'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay inaad nala soo xiriirtay. Waan helnay codsigaaga, waana soo jawaabi doonnaa sida ugu dhaqso badan ee suurtogalka ah.','View your request'=>'Eeg codsigaaga','[#%1$d] New ticket: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Tikidh cusub: %2$s','Open the ticket'=>'Fur tikidhka','[#%1$d] New reply: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Jawaab cusub: %2$s','You can reply on the page below.'=>'Waxaad ku jawaabi kartaa bogga hoose.','View and reply'=>'Eeg oo ka jawaab','[#%1$d] Customer replied: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Macaamiilku waa ay jawaabeen: %2$s','A visitor is waiting in chat #%d'=>'Booqde ayaa ku sugan sheeko furan #%d','A visitor asked to talk to a person and is waiting for an answer.'=>'Booqasho-baxuhu wuxuu codsaday inuu la hadlo qof wuxuuna sugayaa jawaab.','Answer now'=>'Hadda ka jawaab','Your chat with %s'=>'Sheekadaada lala leeyahay %s','[#%d] Your link to your request'=>'[#%d] Xiriirka codsigaaga','Here is a new link to your request. The old one no longer works.'=>'Waa kan xiriir cusub oo ku socda codsigaaga. Kii hore hadda ma shaqeynayo.','From: %s'=>'Ka: %s','a visitor'=>'booqde','Zinn® Chat chats and support tickets'=>'Wadahadalada Zinn® Chat iyo tigidhada taageerada','Chats'=>'Sheekooyinka','Started'=>'Bilowday','Name'=>'Magaca','Email'=>'Iimayl','Page'=>'Bogga','Messages'=>'Fariimaha','Support tickets'=>'Caawinta tigidhada','Ticket'=>'Tikidhada','Opened'=>'La furay','When you use the chat or submit a support request, we store your messages, the name and email address you give us, the page you were on and a coded form of your IP address, so that we can answer you and keep a record of your request.'=>'Marka aad isticmaasho wada-sheekaysiga ama aad soo gudbiso codsi taageero, waxaan keydinaa fariimahaaga, magaca iyo cinwaanka iimaylka ee aad na siiso, boggii aad joogtay iyo qaabka koodaysan ee cinwaankaaga IP, si aan ugu jawaabno oo aan u ilaalino diiwaanka codsigaaga.','If our AI assistant answers you, your message and passages from this website are sent to the AI provider we use to produce the answer.'=>'Haddii kaaliyahayaga AI uu ku siiyo jawaab, fariintaada iyo qaybaha ka mid ah mareegtan waxaa loo diraa bixiyaha AI ee aan isticmaalno si loo soo saaro jawaabta.','This chat has ended.'=>'Wadahadalkani wuu dhammaaday.','The chat is not available right now.'=>'Wadahadalku hadda ma heli karo.','Please type a message.'=>'Fadlan qor fariin.','Please agree to the privacy notice to start the chat.'=>'Fadlan oggolow ogeysiiska sirta ah si aad u bilowdo wada-hadalka.','You have started too many chats today. Please try again tomorrow or send us a ticket.'=>'Waxaad bilowday wada-sheekaysi aad u badan maanta. Fadlan isku day markale berrito ama noo soo dir tigidh.','The chat could not be started. Please try again.'=>'Sheekadu lama bilaabi karin. Fadlan dib u dayis.','Nobody can answer in chat right now. Leave your email address and we will reply by email.'=>'Qofna hadda kama jawaabi karo wada-sheekaysiga. Ka tag ciwaankaaga iimaylka oo waxaan kuugu soo jawaabi doonaa iimayl ahaan.','The assistant cannot answer right now. You can ask for a person or leave us a message.'=>'Caawiyuhu ma jawaabi karo hadda. Waxaad codsan kartaa qof ama waxaad nooga tagi kartaa fariin.','We are putting you through to a person. Please stay on this page.'=>'Waxaan ku xireynaa qof. Fadlan ku sug boggan.','Tickets are not available right now.'=>'Tikidhada laguma heli karo hadda.','Visitor'=>'Booqde','Team'=>'Kooxaha','Chat so far:'=>'Wadahadalka illaa hadda:','Thank you. Your request is ticket #%d and we will reply by email.'=>'Mahadsanid. Codsigaagu waa tikidhka #%d waana kuugu jawaabi doonaa iimayl ahaan.','Please enter a valid email address.'=>'Fadlan geli ciwaan email oo sax ah.','This link is not valid.'=>'Xiriirintani ma aha mid ansax ah.','This link has expired. We can email you a new one.'=>'Xiriirintani waa ay dhacday. Waan ku soo diri karnaa xiriiri cusub email ahaan.','You cannot see this ticket.'=>'Ma arki kartid tigidhkan.','Hi! Ask me anything about this site. I answer from its own pages, and I can put you through to a person.'=>'Haye! Wax iga waydii goobtan. Waxaan uga jawaabaa boggeeda, waxaanna kuu xiriirin karaa qof.','Hi! How can we