f %2$s'=>'Macaamiisha martigelinta? Hel %1$d%% dhimis %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'Si aad u noqoto macmiil martigelinta ee Zinn Digital®, waxaad heleysaa kood shaqsiyeed oo ah %d%% dhimis lacagtaada koowaad. Cusboonaysiinta waxaa lagu sameeyaa qiimaha caadiga ah.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Hel %d%% code-kayga oo tag bixinta lacagta','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Qiimtahan dhimista ah waxaa loogu talagalay macaamiisha haysta qorshe martigelin oo la bixiyay oo xaaladiisu wanaagsan tahay. Tijaabooyinka bilaashka ah uma qalmaan.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Waxaad horay u isticmaashay dhimistaada martigeliyaha macaamiisha ee plugin-kan.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Waqtigan xaadirka ah ma aan helin koodkaaga. Fadlan isku day mar kale dhowr daqiiqo gudahood.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaasha iyo adeegyada','User guides'=>'Hagayaasha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri %s hagaha isticmaalaha','Hide this'=>'Qari tan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® hosting for WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, gurmadyada maalinlaha ah, haajiradda bilaashka ah iyo guddiga xakamaynta ee loogu talagalay dadka wada in ka badan hal goob.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibsii oo iibi mareegaha la aas-aasay, agabyada domain-ka iyo meelaynta xiriiriyeyaasha, adoo lacagta si ammaan ah u haya ilaa labada dhinac ay ka farxayaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — kireyso dadkan u shaqaysta xirfad ahaan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqa caalamiga ah ee xorta ah: ka baadh in ka badan 10,000 adeeg oo diyaar ah oo ka yimid qorayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyeyaasha iyo khubarada SEO, ama soo dhig mashruuc oo u ogolow inay ku tartamaan.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Eeg qoraallada sii-daynta ee Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Adeegga cusboonaysiinta ee Zinn® ayaan soo saarin xiriiriye soo dejineed oo loogu talagalay cusboonaysiintan. Hubi in boggani uu gaari karo madal Zinn®, kadibna isku day mar labaad.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Cusbooneysiin lama soo dejin karo adeegga cusboonaysiinta ee Zinn® (%s). Iskey mar kale ugu day daqiiqado yar kadib.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiintii la soo dejiyey waa ay ku guuldareysatay baaritaanka daacadnimadeeda mana aan lagu rakibin.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'ruqis shatiga','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Adeegsadealiyihii weli lama xiriirin shatiga, kaas oo lagama maarmaan u ah in laga hortago hawlgelinta aan la oggolayn. Si aad shatiga ugu abuurto adeegsadahaaga, waxaad ogolaatay in aad la wadaagto magacaaga buuxa ee WordPress iyo cinwaanka emaylka.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'goobaha kor ku xusan','Account'=>'Koontada','Account Details'=>'Xogta Koontada','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Koontadu waxay sugeysaa in la hawlgeliyo. Fadlan hubi iimaylkaaga oo guji xiriiriyaha si aad u hawlgeliso koontadaada ka dibna mar kale soo gudbi foomka wakiilka.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Ma rabtaa inaad ku darto %1$s gudaha %2$s?','Actions'=>'Falmaha','Activate'=>'Hawlgeli','Activate Free Version'=>'Hawlgal Nuqulka Bilaashka ah','Activate License'=>'Dhaqaaji Shatiga','activate a license here'=>'haysiis shaqaynaysa halkan ka yeel','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Fadlan geli furaha shatiga ee aad ku heshay iimaylka isla markiiba iibsashada ka dib:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Ku shaqaysii ruqhsada dhammaan mareegaha shabakadda dhexdeeda.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Kici sharciga dhammaan mareegaha la sugayo.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>' Nooca lacagta ah ee %1$s waa horay loo rakibay. Fadlan hawlgeli si aad u bilowdo ka faa\'iidaysiga sifooyinka %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>' Nooca lacagta ah ee %1$s waa horay loo rakibay. Fadlan u gudub %2$s si aad u dhaqaajiso oo aad uga bilow faa\'iidada sifooyinka %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Kici lifaaqan','Activate %s'=>'Hawl gali %s','Activate %s features'=>'Dhaqaaji astaamaha %s','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Hadda Dhammaystir Hawlgelinta "%s"','Activate %s Plan'=>'Fawdil Salka %s','Activated'=>'La hawlgeliyay','Activating'=>'Hawlgelinaya','Activating license'=>'Liisanka oo la hawlgelinayo','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'Koontadaada ayaa si guul leh loogu hawlgeliyay qorshaha %s.','active add-onActive'=>'Shaqaynaya','Add another domain'=>'Ku dar domain kale','Add-Ons'=>'Ku-Darayaal','Add Ons for %s'=>'Adeegyada dheeraadka ah ee %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Waan ku guuldarraysannay inaan soo rarno liiska lifaaqyada. Waxay u badan tahay inay tahay cilad dhankayaga ah, fadlan isku day inaad soo noqotid dhowr daqiiqo ka dib.','Add-On'=>'Ku-dar','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s waa lagu daray oo ah mid qaali ah oo keliya. Waa inaad marka hore iibsataa shati ka hor inta aanad hawlgelin plugin-ka.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'%s Ku-daraha waxaa si guul leh loo iibsaday.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'Qorshahaaga ku-kordhinta ee %s waa la casriyeeyay si guul leh.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'%s ee tijaabada bilaashka ah waa la joojiyay. Maadaama darawalka uu yahay mid lacag ah oo qura, waa la demiyay. Haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inaad isticmaasho mustaqbalka, waa inaad iibsataa shati.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s lama shaqeyn karo plug-in-ka la\'aanteed.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s ma shaqeyn karo iyadoo %2$s aysan jirin.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Waan ku ogeysiinayaa in xogta dheeriga ah ee %s laga soo jiidayo server dibadda ah.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Dar-geliyeyaasha module %s','Address Line %d'=>'Cinwaanka %d','Affiliate'=>'Wakiilka','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Sabab la xiriirta in lagu xad-gudbay shuruudaheenna xiriirinta, waxaan go\'aansannay inaan si ku-meel-gaar ah u xirno akoonkaaga xiriirinta. Haddii aad qabtid wax su\'aalo ah, fadlan la xiriir taageerada.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'Koontadaada xiriirka waxaa la joojiyay si KMG ah.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'Cods sigmadaada ee %1$s waa la aqbalay! Soo gal aaggaaga sigmada adoo isticmaalaya: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Waan ku mahadcelineynaa codsigaaga ku aaddan barnaamijka shuraakada, nasiib darro, waxaan go\'aansannnay inaan diidno codsigaaga xilligan. Fadlan isku day mar labaad 30 maalmood ka dib.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay inaad soo codsatay barnaamijkayaga xiriirinta, waxaan eegi doonaa maahfaahintaada 14-ka maalmood ee soo socda dhexdeeda waxaanan kuugu soo jawaabi doonaa xog dheeraad ah.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'%s kookiga la socodka booqashada kowaad kadib si loo kordhiyo dakhliga suurtagalka ah.','Affiliation'=>'Xubinimada','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Marka uu ruqsadadu dhacdo, waxaad weli isticmaali kartaa nooca Bilaashka ah laakiin ma heli doontid sifooyinka %s.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Markabkaagu markuu dhaco, ma awoodi doontid inaad isticmaashid %s, ilaa aad ka hawlgeliso mar kale oo leh ruqsad qiimo leh oo sax ah.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Weli waad ku raaxaysan kartaa dhammaan sifooyinka %1$s laakiin ma heli doontid amniga %2$s iyo cusboonaysiinta sifooyinka, mana helaysid taageero.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Mahadsanid casriyeynta.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Ka dib %1$s-kaaga bilaashka ah, bixi wax aan badnayn %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Ogolow & Dhaqaaji Shatiga','I Agree - Change User'=>'Waan Ku Heshiiyay - Beddel Isticmaalaha','All Requests'=>'Codsashada Oo Dhan','All Types'=>'Noocyo Dhammaan','allow'=>'ogolow','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Horay ayaad uga qaybgashey la socodka isticmaalkayaga, taas oo naga caawisa inaan sii wadno horumarinta %s.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Horay ayaad uga qaybgashay la socodka isticmaalkayaga, taas oo naga caawisa inaan sii wadno horumarintooda.','Amount'=>'Qadarka','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Sanadle','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Sanad kasta','Anonymous feedback'=>'Jawaabta aan la aqoon in loo garto','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Ku dabool dhammaan bogagga shabakadda ee shabakadda.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Ku dabool dhammaan mareegaha sugaya.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Codso si aad u noqotid xigeen','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Anoggol & Bilow Tijaabada','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Fadlan noo sheeg sababta si aan u horumarino.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Geli cinwaanka iimaylka ee aad u adeegsatay kor u qaadista hoos waxaanuna dib kuu soo diri doonaa furaha ruqsadda.','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Geli ciwaanka iimaylka ee aad adeegsatay intii lagu guda jiray iibsashada waxaanuna dib kuu soo diri doonaa furaha shatiyeynta.','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'La xiriir koontada mulkiilaha shatiga.','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'Qoraa','Invalid module ID.'=>'Aqoonsiga module-ka waa khalad.','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'Ma haytid shati sax ah oo aad ku gasho nooca qaaliga ah.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Ku-rakibida otomaatiga ah waxay u shaqeysaa oo keliya isticmaaleyaasha is-diiwaangeliyey.','Premium version already active.'=>'Nooca Premium horay buu u shaqaynayaa.','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'Nooca kordhinta ee qaaliga ah ayaa horay loo rakibay.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Plugin waa "Serviceware", taas oo la macno ah inuusan lahayn nooc code ah oo lacag ah.','Automatic Installation'=>'Ku-shubidda Tooska ah','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Demiso isku-xirka ee:','Average Rating'=>'Astaanta Dhexe','Awesome'=>'Cajiib','based on %s'=>'ku saleysan %s','Become an affiliate'=>'Noqoshada xubin ka tirsan barnaamijka la-taliyayaasha','Like the %s? Become our ambassador and earn cash ;-)'=>'Ma jeceshahay %s? Noqo safiirkayaga oo lacag kasbo ;-)','Hey there, did you know that %1$s has an affiliate program? If you like the %2$s you can become our ambassador and earn some cash!'=>'Hey there, ma ogtahay in %1$s uu leeyahay barnaamij la-hawlgalayaal ah? Haddii aad jeceshahay %2$s waxaad noqon kartaa safiirkeenna oo aad lacag ka samayn kartaa!','e.g. the best productBest'=>'Ugu Fiican','Beta'=>'Beta','An update to a Beta version will replace your installed version of %s with the latest Beta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Cusboonaysiiyaha nooca Beta wuxuu bedeli doonaa nooca %s ee aad rakibtay nooca ugu dambeeya ee Beta - si taxadar leh u isticmaal, hana ku isticmaalin boggaga shaqada. Waa lagu digtay.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'Lagu billaabay %s','Billing'=>'Biilasha','Billing & Invoices'=>'Lacag-bixinta & Biilasha','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'Xayiran','Blocking'=>'Xannibayaa','Blog ID'=>'Aqoonsiga Blog-ga','Body'=>'Jirridka','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Haa - labada ciwaanba waa kuwayga','Bundle'=>'Xirmo','Bundle Plan'=>'Qorshaha Xirmada','Business name'=>'Magaca ganacsiga','Buy license'=>'Iibsow ruqxsadda','Buy a license now'=>'Hadda iibso shati','Cancel Installation'=>'Jooji Rakibaadda','Cancel Subscription'=>'Jooji Is-diiwaangelinta','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Haddii aanad qorsheyneynin inaad isticmaasho %1$s-kan mareegtan (ama mareeg kasta oo kale) - ma jeceshahay inaad joojiso %2$s sidoo kale?','Cancel Trial'=>'Jooji Imtixaanka','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Joojinta tijaabada waxay isla markiiba xiri doontaa gelitaanka dhammaan sifooyinka qaali ah. Ma hubtaa?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'Jooji %s & Sii wad','Cancelled'=>'La baab\'iyey','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Diiwaangelinta la joojinayo','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Ma heli kartid furahaaga shatiga?','Change License'=>'Bedel Shatiga','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'Iimayl xaqiijin ah ayaa hadda loo diray %s. Waa inaad xaqiijisaa cusboonaysiinta 4-ta saacadood ee soo socota. Haddii aadan heli karin iimaylka, fadlan hubi galkaaga spam-ka.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'Farriin xaqiijin ah ayaa hadda loo diray %s. Mulkiilaha iimaylku waa inuu xaqiijiyo cusboonaysiinta 4-ta saacadood ee soo socota gudahooda.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s waa mulkiilaha cusub ee koontada.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Mahadsan sanid xaqiijinta isbeddelka lahaanshaha. Iimayl ayaa hadda loo diray %s si loo ansixiyo ugu dambeeya.','Change Ownership'=>'Beddel Milkiyadda','Change Plan'=>'Beddel Qorshaha','Change User'=>'Bedel Isticmaalaha','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Markabka adoo beddelaya, waxaad ogolaaneysaa in aad xisaabta mulkiyadeeda u wareejiso:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Diiwaanka Isbeddellada','Changing user, please wait'=>'Bedelaya isticmaalaha, fadlan sug','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Haddii aadan helin iimaylka, isku day inaad hubiso galkaaga spam-ka ama ka raadi iimaylada ka yimid %4$s.','Checkout'=>'Bixi lacagta','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Dooro ilaa %s oo goob(bo) ah oo lagu hawlgelinayo shatiga.','City'=>'Magaalada','Clear API Cache'=>'Nadiifi Kaydka API','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Masax Cusboonaysiinta Ku-meel-gaarka ah','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Halkan riix','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Guji halkan si aad plugin-ka u isticmaasho adigoo aan la aqoon','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'Guji si aad u aragto faallooyinka bixiyay qiimeynta %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s waa ciwaanka iimaylka macmiilkayga','Code'=>'Koodh','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'%s komishan marka macaamilku uu iibsado shati cusub.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Maaddaama aanu 30 maalmood u kaydinno lacag-celinta suurtagalka ah, waxaan bixinnaa oo keliya guddiyada ka da\'weyn 30 maalmood.','Communication'=>'Isgaarsiinta','Compatible up to'=>'La jaanqaadi kara ilaa','complete the opt-in'=>'dhammaystir ka-mid-noqoshada','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Hambalyo','Never miss an important update'=>'Weligaa ha seegin wararkii ugu dambeeyay ee muhiimka ah','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay cusboonaysiinta %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Is-diiwaangeli si aad u hesho ogeysiisyada iimeelka ee ku saabsan amniga & cusboonaysiinta sifooyinka, waxyaabaha waxbarashada, iyo dalabyada marmarka qaarkood, iyo inaad la wadaagto xoogaa macluumaad deegaanka WordPress ah. Tani waxay naga caawin doontaa inaan ka dhigno %s mid la jaanqaadi kara mareegahaaga oo si fiican u qabta waxaad u baahan tahay.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Isku qor si aad u hesho ogeysiisyada iimaylka ee ku saabsan cusboonaysiinta amniga & sifooyinka, waxa ku jira waxbarashada, iyo dalabyada marmarka qaarkood, iyo inaad la wadaagto xoogaa macluumaad aasaasi ah oo WordPress deegaanka ah.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Haddii aad tani ka booddo, waa caadi! %1$s weli si fiican ayuu u shaqayn doonaa.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Waxaan soo bandhignay ikhtiyaarkan si aadan weligood u seegin cusboonaysiin muhiim ah oo naga caawiso inaan ka dhigno %s mid si fiican ula jaanqaada boggaaga oo uga sii fiican fulinta waxaad uga baahan tahay.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Waan ku faraxsanahay inaan soo bandhigno is-dhexgalka heerka shabakadda Freemius.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Intii lagu guda jiray habka cusboonaysiinta waxaanu ka helnay %s mareeg(yo) shabakadda dhexdeeda ah oo weli u baahan dareenkaaga.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Intii uu socday howsha cusboonaysiinta, waxaan ogaannnay %d goob(bo) oo weli sugaysa in shatiga la hawlgeliyo.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Haddii aad rabto inaad isticmaasho %s boggagaas, fadlan geli furahaaga ruqsadaha hoose oo guji badhanka hawlgelinta.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Haddii kale, waad iska dhaafi kartaa hadda oo aad shatiga dib ka hawlgelin kartaa, bogga Koontada heerka shabakadda ee %sada.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Ku xidhan','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Marka aad dhammeyso, dami %s oo dib u daari.','Contact'=>'La xiriir','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Fadlan noo soo sheeg haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inay nagu soo xiriiraan cusboonaysiinta amniga & sifooyinka, waxyaabaha waxbarashada, iyo dalabyada marmarka qaarka ah:','Contact Support'=>'La xiriir Taageerada','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Waan ka xumahay dhibaatada soo gaartay, waana joognaa si aan ku caawino haddii aad fursad na siiso.','Contact Us'=>'Nala soo xiriir','Please contact us here'=>'Fadlan nagala soo xiriir halkaan','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Fadlan nagala soo xiriir fariinta soo socota:','Continue'=>'Sii wad','Contributors'=>'Ka-qaybgalayaasha','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'Lama dhaqaajin karo %s.','Country'=>'Waddanka','Cron Type'=>'Noocyada Cron','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'Waxaan u adeegsannaa maktabadda PHP cURL wicitaanada API, taas oo ah maktabad aad u caan ah oo badanaa ku rakiban kuna shaqeysa si toos ah. Nasiib darro, cURL lama shaqaysiin (ama waa la damiyay) server-kaaga.','data'=>'xogta','Debug mode was successfully enabled and will be automatically disabled in 60 min. You can also disable it earlier by clicking the "Stop Debug" link.'=>'Habka khalid-saaridda (Debug mode) waa la hawlgeliyay waxaana si otomaatig ah loo damin doonaa 60 daqiiqo gudahood. Waxaad sidoo kale damin kartaa horay adiga oo gujinaya xiriiriyaha "Stop Debug".','Date'=>'Taariikhda','Deactivate'=>'Dami','Deactivate the free version'=>'Demakii nuuska lacag la\'aanta ah','Deactivate License'=>'Dami Shatarka','Deactivating your license will block all premium features, but will enable activating the license on another site. Are you sure you want to proceed?'=>'Daminta sharcigaagu waxay xiri doontaa dhammaan sifooyinka qaaliga ah, laakiin waxay sahlaysaa in sharciga lagu hawlgeliyo goob kale. Ma hubtaa inaad rabto inaad sii waddo?','Deactivation'=>'Joojinta hawlgelinta','Yes - %s'=>'Haa - %s','Submit & %s'=>'Gudbi & %s','Deactivating or uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Joojinta ama ka saaridda %s waxay si toos ah u deejineysaa shatiga, kaas oo aad ku isticmaali karto degel kale.','If you have a moment, please let us know why you are %s'=>'Haddii aad waqti haysato, fadlan noo soo sheeg sababta aad u tahay %s','Debug Log'=>'Diiwaanka Cilmi-baaridda','as code debuggingDebugging'=>'Culadka Ciladaha','delegate'=>'wakiil u noqo','If you click it, this decision will be delegated to the sites administrators.'=>'Haddii aad gujiso, go\'aankan waxaa loo wakiishan doonaa maamulayaasha mareegaha.','Delegate to Site Admins'=>'U wakiil maamulayaasha goobta','Delegate to Site Admins & Continue'=>'U wakiil Maamulayaasha Goobta & Sii wad','Delegating, please wait'=>'Waa la wareejinayaa, fadlan sug','verbDelete'=>'Tiro tir','Delete All Accounts'=>'Tirako Dhammaan Koontooyinka','Are you sure you want to delete all Freemius data?'=>'Ma hubtaa inaad rabto inaad tirtirto dhammaan xogta Freemius?','Plugin installer section titleDescription'=>'Sharaxaada','Details'=>'Faahfaahin','seems like the key you entered doesn\'t match our records.'=>'waxaa u muuqata in furaha aad gelisay uusan waafaqsaneyn diiwaankayaga.','Diagnostic Info'=>'Macluumaadka Baaritaanka','Disabling white-label mode'=>'Qaabka calaamadda-caddaanka (white-label) oo la daminayo','Disconnect'=>'Gooyey','Are you sure you would like to proceed with the disconnection?'=>'Ma hubtaa inaad rabto inaad sii waddo goynta?','If you wish to cancel your %1$s plan\'s subscription instead, please navigate to the %2$s and cancel it there.'=>'Haddii aad rabto inaad halkii ka joojiso rukumashada qorshahaaga %1$s, fadlan u soco %2$s oo halkaas kaga jooji.','as close a windowDismiss'=>'Ka tago','do %1$sNOT%2$s send me security & feature updates, educational content and offers.'=>'ha %1$sHUGAD%2$s i soo diri cusboonaysiinta amniga & sifooyinka, waxyaabaha waxbarashada iyo dalabyada.','Enter the domain of your website or other websites from where you plan to promote the %s.'=>'Geli magaca domain-ka mareegahaaga ama mareegaha kale ee aad qorsheyneyso inaad ka soo xayeysiiso %s.','Where are you going to promote the %s?'=>'Halkee ayaad qorsheyneysaa inaad ku ololeyso %s?','Domain is required.'=>'Magaca domain-ka waa khasab.','Donate to this plugin'=>'Ku deeq barnaamijkan ku-xidhan','Don\'t cancel %s - I\'m still interested in getting security & feature updates, as well as be able to contact support.'=>'Ha joojin %s -Weli waxaan xiiseynayaa inaan helo ammaan & cusbooneysiin sifeyn ah, iyo sidoo kale inaan awood u yeesho inaan la xiriiro taageerada.','Don\'t have a license key?'=>'Ma haysatid furaha liisan-ka?','You might have missed it, but you don\'t have to share any data and can just %s the opt-in.'=>'Waa laga yaabaa inaad seegtay, laakiin khasab kuma aha inaad la wadaagto xog kasta oo waxaad si fudud u %s kartaa xulashada.','verbDowngrade'=>'Hoos u dhig','%1$s will immediately stop all future recurring payments and your %2$s plan license will expire in %3$s.'=>'%1$s waxay si degdeg ah u joojin doontaa dhammaan lacag-bixin