 from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'Marka aad iska diiwaangeliso in aan lagu wadaagin macluumaadkan server-ka cusboonaysiinta, waa inaad hubisaa %1$s cusboonaysiinta cusub oo aad gacanta ku soo dejisaa oo aad gelisaa. Ma aha oo kaliya dhibaato, laakiin seegista cusboonaysiinta waxay gelin kartaa boggaaga halis waxayna keeni kartaa dhibaatooyin waafaqsan oo aan loo baahnayn, markaa waxaan si xoog leh ugu talinaynaa in la ilaaliyo oggolaanshaha muhiimka ah.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'Jooji %1$s - Uma baahni mar dambe wax cusbooneysiin ah oo ku saabsan amniga iyo astaamaha, mana u baahni taageero ku saabsan %2$s sababtoo ah ma qorsheynayo inaan isticmaalo %3$s kan, ama bog kale toona.','Cancel %s?'=>'Ma joojisaa %s?','Cancelling %s'=>'Joojinaya %s','Cancelling %s...'=>'Waxaa la joojinayaa %s...','Click here'=>'Halkan riix','Deactivating'=>'Hawlgabinta','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Go\'ynta mareegaha waxay si joogto ah uga saari doontaa %s koontada Dashboard-ka Isticmaalahaaga.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Si loo helo amniga iyo cusboonaysiinta sifooyinka si otomaatig ah, iyo maamulka iyo ilaalinta shatiga, %s waxay u baahan tahay in:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Si loo gaarsiiyo amniga & cusboonaysiinta sifooyinka, iyo maaraynta shatiga, %s waxay u baahan tahay','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius waa shatigayaga iyo matoorayada cusboonaysiinta barnaamijka','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Haddii tani ay tahay nuqul muddo dheer ah, si aad u ilaaliso cusboonaysiinta tooska ah iyo shaqaynta lacagta ah ka dib %1$s, fadlan %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'Ma %2$s ma waa nuqul ka mid ah %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Ku Biir Barnaamijka Beta','Join the Beta program'=>'Ku biir barnaamijka Beta','License'=>'Ruqsad','License Key'=>'Furaha Shatiga','License key'=>'Fureeyaha shatiga','Monthly'=>'Bisha','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Magacyada, gaaban (slugs), noocyada, iyo haddii ay shaqeynayaan iyo inkale','New Version Available'=>'Nooca Cusub Waa La Heli Karaa','Optional'=>'Ikhtiyaari','Plan'=>'Qorshe','Products'=>'Badeecadaha','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Xogta baaritaanka oo la wadaago waxay gacan ka geysataa bixinta shaqooyin dheeraad ah oo khuseeya mareegtaada, ka fogaanshaha WordPress ama noocyada PHP ee aan is-waafaqeyn ee jabin kara mareegta, iyo aqoonsashada luqadaha & gobollada ay tahay in %s loo turjumo laguna habeeyo.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Si aad dib ugu isticmaasho shatiyada marka %s uusan sii shaqaynayn.','Subscription'=>'Rukun-dhaqmeed','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s waxay si joogto ah ugu diri doontaa xogta ruqsadaha muhiimka ah %2$s si ay u hubiso amniga iyo cusboonaysiinta sifooyinka, isla markaana ay u xaqiijiso jiritaanka ruqsadadaada.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'Waxaa jira %1$s oo ah %2$s la heli karo.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Si loo xaqiijiyo waafaqidda looguna fogaado khilaafaadka plugins-ka iyo mawduucyada aad rakibtay.','Trial'=>'Tijaabo','View %s State'=>'Eeg Xaaladda %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Eeg Macluumaadka Aasassiga ah ee %s','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Haa, %2$s waa nuqul ka mid ah %4$s ujeedada tijaabada, diyaarinta, ama horumarinta.','You have a %s license.'=>'Waxaad haysataa shati %s ah.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Waxaad iibsatay shati %s ah.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'Waa inaad hesho iimayl xaqiijin ah oo ku saabsan %1$s sanduuqaaga iimaylka ee %2$s. Fadlan hubi inaad gujiso badhanka iimaylkaas ku jira si aad u %3$s.','days'=>'maalmo','deactivating'=>'gabaynaya','hour'=>'saacad','hours'=>'saacadood','license'=>'shati','optional'=>'ikhtiyaari','products'=>'Alaabaha','skip'=>'ka bood','subscription'=>'ruujin','trial'=>'imtixaanka','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Badeecadaha','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Waa la hawlgelinayaa','as software licenseLicense'=>'Ruqsad','close a windowDismiss'=>'Diid','close windowDismiss'=>'Diid','like websitesSites'=>'Goobaha','nounPricing'=>'Qiimaha','trial periodTrial'=>'Tijaabo','verbOpt In'=>'Isdiiwaangeli','verbOpt Out'=>'Ka bax','verbSkip'=>'Ka bood','verbUpgrade'=>'Kor u qaad','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s ka hor','Price: %s'=>'Qiimaha: %s','(on sale, normally %s)'=>'(iib ayaan ku jiraa, inta badan waa %s)','SKU: %s'=>'SKU: %s','Weight: %s'=>'Miisaanka: %s','Dimensions: %s'=>'Cabirrada: %s','Rated %1$s out of 5 from %2$d reviews'=>'Qiimeysan %1$s oo ah %2$d dib u eegis laga soo bilaabo','Sold at: %s'=>'La iibiyay: %s','any'=>'kasta','Option'=>'Xulasho','Out of stock'=>'Kaydsan ma jiro','Available on backorder'=>'Waa la dalban karaa iyadoo keydku ka dhammaaday','In stock (%d)'=>'Kaydka ku jira (%d)','In stock'=>'Keymaha ku jira','Everywhere else'=>'Meel kasta oo kale','orders over %s'=>'dalabyada ka sarreeya %s','Shipping to %1$s%2$s: %3$s'=>'Loo rarayo %1$s%2$s: %3$s','Payment methods: %s'=>'Hababka lacag-bixinta: %s','Prices are in %s.'=>'Qiimayaashu waxay ku jiraan %s.','Store address: %s'=>'Ciwaanka dukaanka: %s','Refund and returns policy: %s'=>'Siyaasadda lacag-celinta iyo soo-celinta: %s','Shipping, payment and store information'=>'Dhoofinta, bixinta iyo macluumaadka dukaanka','Reply:'=>'Jawaab:','yes'=>'Haa','no'=>'maya','Reading this page used more memory than the site allows, so it was skipped.'=>'Akhrinta boggan waxay isticmaashay xusuus ka badan inta ay boggu ogolyahay, markaa waa la booday.','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Tallaabadan lama awoodin in la buuxiyo. Dib u day, oo haddii ay sii waddo in ay fashilanto, la xiriir maamulaha mareegta.','Connect an AI app'=>'Ku xidh barnaamijka AI','This connection request has expired. Go back to the app and start connecting again.'=>'Codsigan isku-xirka wuu dhacay. Ku noqo abka oo mar kale bilow isku-xirka.','%1$s is asking to use %2$s on this site as %3$s. It can do only what your WordPress account is allowed to do, and you can disconnect it at any time from the AI agents (MCP) settings.'=>'%1$s wuxuu codsanayaa inuu ku isticmaalo %2$s boggan sida %3$s. Waxa kaliya ee uu samayn karaa waa waxa akoonkaaga WordPress loo oggol yahay inuu sameeyo, waxaanad ka jari kartaa wakhti kasta goobaha wakiilada AI (MCP).','%1$s identified itself from %2$s.'=>'%1$s wuxuu iska aqoonsaday %2$s.','%1$s registered itself automatically. Only continue if you started this from %2$s.'=>'%1$s ayaa si toos ah isu diiwaangeliyay. Kaliya sii wad haddii aad tan ka bilowday %2$s.','Your account cannot use these tools on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Koontadaadu ma isticmaali karto qalabkan boggan. Weydii maamulaha.','After you answer you will go back to %s.'=>'Ka dib markaad jawaabto waxaad ku noqon doontaa %s.','Allow %s'=>'Oggolow %s','Do not allow'=>'Ha oggolaan','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Qiime loo baahan yahay ayaa maqan ama wata qaab khaldan. Hubi nidaamka gelitaanka awoodda.','The site refused the request.'=>'Goobtu waxay diiday codsiga.','Unknown tool.'=>'Qalab aan la garanayn.','Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'U oggolow caawiyayaasha AI sida Claude, Cursor ama VS Code inay goobtan kuugu shaqeeyaan iyagoo adeegsanaya MCP (Model Context Protocol). Waxay ku soo galaan isticmaale WordPress ahaan (Claude iyo ChatGPT adoo halkan ka ansixinaya, kuwa kalena erayga sirta ah ee abka) waxayna qaban karaan oo keliya waxa isticmaalahaas loo oggol yahay inuu sameeyo.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'Wakiilada AI waxay u baahan yihiin WordPress 6.9 ama ka dambeeya. Cusboonaysii WordPress si aad u isticmaasho.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'Cinwaanka xiriirka (MCP endpoint)','Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead'=>'Claude iyo ChatGPT: taaa beddelkeeda gal','Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy.'=>'Ku dar ciwaanka xidhiidhka xidhiidhiye gaar ah Claude dhexdiisa, ama abka ahaan habka horumariyaha ChatGPT. Waxay furayaan goobtan si aad u ansixiso; ma jiro eray sir ah oo la koobiyeeyo.','AI apps connected to your account:'=>'App-yada AI ee ku xiran koontadaada:','Other AI apps: an application password'=>'Barnaamijyada kale ee AI: furaha sirta ah ee barnaamijka','Create an application password for your user'=>'Samee erayga sirta ah ee abka ee isticmaalahaaga','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Tan ku dar jaangooyooyinka MCP ee abkaaga AI, adoo adeegsanaya magacaaga isticmaale iyo eraygaas sirta ah:','VS Code: put the same entry under "servers" in .vscode/mcp.json, not under "mcpServers".'=>'VS Code: gali isla gelitaankaas hoosta "servers" ee .vscode/mcp.json, ee ha ka hoos marin "mcpServers".','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Qalabka wakiilka AI uu halkan isticmaali karo (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Hagaha isticmaalaha: Wakiilada AI iyo MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Dukumentiyada horumariyaha: awoodaha, REST iyo MCP','Answer this site\'s live chats and support tickets with Zinn® Chat.'=>'Kaga jawaab wada-sheekaysiga tooska ah iyo tigidhada taageero ee boggan Zinn® Chat.','Live chats, support tickets, the AI assistant and the help desk.'=>'Sheekooyinka tooska ah, tigidhada taageerooyinka, kaaliyaha AI iyo adeegga caawinta.','Read the support overview'=>'Akhri dulmarka taageerada','Returns how many tickets are in each status and how many chats are waiting for a person (and their unread messages), and whether the chat, the assistant and tickets are switched on.'=>'Waxay soo celineysaa inta tigidh ee xaalad kasta ku jirta iyo inta wadahadal ee sugaya qof (iyo fariimahooda aan la akhriyin), iyo in wadahadalka, kaaliyaha iyo tigidhada la shiday.','Read the chat settings'=>'Akhri habaynta sheekada','Returns every chat setting: the widget, the assistant, people and opening hours, tickets and email, the site index, privacy and spam.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa dhammaan dejinta wada-sheekaysiga: widget-ka, kaaliyaha, dadka iyo saacadaha shaqada, tikidhada iyo iimaylka, tusmada goobta, gaar ahaanshaha iyo spam-ka.','Change the chat settings'=>'Beddel goobaha wadahadalka','Changes the settings you send (settings: key to value) and keeps the rest. Each value is checked exactly as on the settings screen; get-settings lists the keys.'=>'Waxay beddeshaa goobaha aad dirto (goobaha: furaha ilaa qiimaha) waxayna haysaa inta kale. Qiime kasta waxaa si dhab ah looga hubiyaa sida uu yahay shaashadda goobaha; get-settings waxay liis garaysaa furayaasha.','There is no chat setting called %s that can be changed here.'=>'Ma jiro goob sheeko oo la yiraahdo %s oo halkan lagu bedeli karo.','Ask the assistant'=>'Weydi caawiyaha','Asks the site\'s AI assistant a question and returns its answer with every source it found.'=>'Wuxuu ka jawaabayaa su\'aasha ka timaadda kaaliyaha AI ee bogga wuxuuna soo celiyaa jawaabtiisa oo wadata dhammaan ilaha uu helay.','The question, as a visitor would ask it (up to 2,000 characters).'=>'Su\'aasha, sida booqdaha u weydiin lahaa (ilaa 2,000 xaraf).','Language code of the answer, e.g. de; the site language when omitted.'=>'Koodhka luuqadda ee jawaabta, tusaale ahaan de; luuqadda barta marka laga tago.','Read a chat'=>'Akhri wada-sheekaysi','Returns one chat\'s messages and visitor details (after: only messages newer than this id).'=>'Waxay soo celisaa fariimaha hal sheekeysi iyo xogta booqdaha (after: fariimaha ka cusub aqoonsigan oo keliya).','Hand a chat back to the assistant'=>'Sheekooyinka ku celi kaaliyaha','Returns a chat to the AI assistant, which answers the visitor from the site\'s content.'=>'Wuxuu chat-ka u celiyaa kaaliyaha AI, kaas oo uga jawaaba booqashada macluumaadka bogga.','Close a chat'=>'Xir wadahadal','Ends a chat; the visitor can still ask for the transcript.'=>'Wuxuu soo gabagabeeyaa wada-sheekaysiga; booqdaha ayaa wali codsan kara qoraalka wada-sheekaysiga.','Reply in a chat'=>'Kaga jawaab sheeko-wadaagaha','Sends a message to the visitor (text), or adds an internal note only agents see (note: true).'=>'Waxay fariin u diraysaa booqdaha (text), ama waxay ku dareysaa qoraal gudaha ah oo wakiillada kaliya ay arkaan (note: true).','Take a chat'=>'Sheeko bilow','Assigns a waiting chat to the signed-in agent, so the visitor talks to a person.'=>'Waxay wada-sheekaysi sugaya u xilsaarta wakiilka soo galay, si booqdaha ula hadlo qof.','Turn a chat into a ticket'=>'Sheekooyinka chat-ka u beddel tigidh','Opens a ticket from a chat so it can be answered by email (needs the visitor\'s email address).'=>'Wuxuu ka furayaa tigidh wadahadal ah si loogu jawaabo iimayl ahaan (wuxuu u baahan yahay cinwaanka iimaylka ee booqdaha).','List live chats'=>'Liiska wada-sheekaysiga tooska ah','Lists the chats waiting, in progress and recently closed, with who is handling each.'=>'Waxay liis garaysaa wadahadallada la sugayo, kuwa socda iyo kuwa dhawaan la xiray, iyada oo la raacayo qofka maamulaya mid kasta.','Which chats: active (default), with the AI assistant, closed, or all.'=>'Wadahadallada kee: firfircoon (sidii hore), ee la socda kaaliyaha AI, xiran, ama dhammaan.','List what the assistant knows'=>'Liiska waxa caawiyaha uu og yahay','Lists the content the assistant answers from, with its index status, a page at a time.'=>'Wuxuu soo bandhigayaa waxyaabaha ay ka jawaabto caawiyaha, oo ay la socoto xaaladdeeda tusmada, bog hal mar ah.','Words in the title or URL.'=>'Erayada ku jira ciwaanka ama URL-ka.','Only items in this state; every state when omitted.'=>'Keliya shayada ku jira xaaladdan; xaalad kasta markii laga tago.','Page number, from 1.'=>'Lambarka bogga, laga bilaabo 1.','Rebuild the assistant\'s search index'=>'Dib u dhis tusmada raadinta kaaliyaha','Rebuilds the search vectors for one item (item_id) or everything (all: true) (managers only).'=>'Waxay dib u dhisaysaa vector-rada raadinta ee hal shay (item_id) ama wax walba (all: true) (maareeyayaasha kaliya).','True: every indexed item; otherwise only item_id.'=>'True: shay kasta oo la calaamadeeyay; haddii kale kaliya item_id.','ID of one indexed item.'=>'Aqoonsiga (ID) hal shay oo la tusmeeyey.','Re-read content into the assistant'=>'Dib ugu akhri waxyaabaha ku jira kaaliyaha','Re-reads one item (item_id) or everything (all: true) into the assistant\'s index (managers only).'=>'Waxay dib u akhridaysaa hal shay (item_id) ama wax kasta (all: true) oo ku jira tusmada kaaliyaha (maamulayaasha kaliya).','True: the whole site; otherwise only item_id.'=>'True: dhammaan bogga; haddii kale item_id oo keliya.','Set your availability'=>'Deji jiritaankaada','Marks the signed-in agent available or away for new chats (away: true or false).'=>'Waxay calaamadinaysaa wakiilka soo galay inuu diyaar u yahay ama ka maqan yahay sheekooyinka cusub (ka maqan: run ama abuur).','True marks the agent away; False (default) available.'=>'True waxay calaamadisaa in wakiilku maqan yahay; False (ugu talagal) inuu diyaar yahay.','List tickets'=>'Liiska tikidhada','Lists support tickets, filtered by status or a search, a page at a time.'=>'Waxay liiska u saaraysaa tigidhada taageerada, iyadoo lagu miiray xaalad ama raadraac, bogkiiba hal mar.','Which tickets: active (open and pending, the default), one status, or all.'=>'Tigidhada noocee ah: kuwa firfircoon (furan iyo kuwa la sugayo, kuwa caadiga ah), xaalad keliya, ama dhammaan.','Words in the subject, the customer\'s name or email.'=>'Erayada ku jira mawduuca, magaca macmiilka ama iimaylka.','Open a ticket'=>'Fur tigidh','Opens a ticket on a customer\'s behalf (their email, a subject and the first message).'=>'Waxay furtaa tigidh iyadoo wakiil ka ah macaamiisha (iimaylkiisa, mawduuca iyo fariinta ugu horreysa).','The customer\'s email address; replies go there.'=>'Cinwaanka iimaylka macmiilka; jawaabuhu halkaas ayay aadaan.','The ticket subject.'=>'Mowduuca tikidhada.','The first message of the ticket.'=>'Farriinta ugu horreysa ee tikidhka.','The customer\'s name.'=>'Magaca macmiilka.','Delete a ticket'=>'Tirtir tikidh','Deletes a ticket and its conversation for good (managers only).'=>'Waxay gebi ahaanba masaxdaa tigidh iyo wadahadalkiisa (maareeyayaasha oo keliya).','Read a ticket'=>'Akhri tigidhka','Returns one ticket with its whole conversation, status, priority and assignee.'=>'Waxay soo celineysaa hal tigidh oo wata wadahadalkiisa oo dhan, heerkiisa, mudnaanta iyo qofka loo xil saaray.','Answer a ticket'=>'Ka jawaab tigidhka','Replies to the customer by email (text), or adds an internal note (note: true); status optionally changes the ticket\'s status.'=>'Wuxuu iimayl ugu jawaabaa macaamiisha (text), ama wuxuu ku darayaa qoraal gudaha ah (note: true); xaaladdu waxay si ikhtiyaari ah u beddeshaa xaaladda tigidhka.','Change a ticket'=>'Beddel tigidhka','Changes a ticket\'s status, priority or assignee.'=>'Wuxuu beddelaa xaaladda tikidhada, mudnaanta ama qofka loo xil saaray.','List saved replies (Pro)'=>'Liiska jawaabaha la keydiyay (Pro)','Lists the saved replies agents can insert, with their shortcuts.'=>'Waxay qortaa jawaabaha la kaydiyay ee ay wakiiladu geli karaan, iyaga oo wata gaabisyadooda.','Save a saved reply (Pro)'=>'Keydi jawaabta la keydiyay (Pro)','Creates or changes a saved reply (title, shortcut, body, department; id to change one).'=>'Waxay abuurtaa ama bedeshaa jawaab la kaydiyay (ciwaan, gaabin, jidh, waax; aqoonsi si loo beddelo mid).','ID of the saved reply to change; a new one when omitted.'=>'Aqoonsiga jawaabta la kaydiyay ee la beddelayo; mid cusub marka laga tago.','The saved reply\'s title.'=>'Cinwaanka jawaabta la keydiyay.','The reply text.'=>'Qoraalka jawaabta.','Short code agents type to insert it (letters, digits, - and _).'=>'Kood gaaban oo wakiilladu qoraan si ay u geliyaan (xarafyo, tirooyin, - iyo _).','Department it belongs to; every department when empty.'=>'Waaxda ay ka tirsan tahay; waax kasta marka ay maran tahay.','Delete a saved reply (Pro)'=>'Tirtir jawaab la keydiyay (Pro)','Deletes a saved reply.'=>'Wuxuu tirtiraa jawaab la keydiyay.','Fill in a saved reply (Pro)'=>'Buuxi jawaab la keydiyay (Pro)','Returns a saved reply\'s text with its placeholders filled for one chat or ticket.'=>'Waxay soo celisaa qoraalka jawaabta la keydiyay iyada oo meelaha banaan ee ku jira ay buuxaan hal wada-sheekaysi ama tigidh ah.','Set a conversation\'s department and tags (Pro)'=>'Deji waaxda iyo summadaha wadahadalka (Pro)','Sets the department and tags of a chat or ticket (kind: chat or ticket; id).'=>'Waxay dejinaysaa waaxda iyo sumadaha sheekaysiga ama tikidhada (nooca: chat ama ticket; id).','Whether id is a ticket (default) or a chat.'=>'Haddii id tahay tigidh (default) ama sheekeysi.','ID of the ticket or chat.'=>'Aqoonsiga (ID) tigidhka ama wada sheekaysiga.','Department name; empty clears it.'=>'Magaca waaxda; faaruqintu way tirtiraysaa.','Tags, replacing the current ones.'=>'Calaamado, beddelaya kuwa hadda jira.','List unanswered questions (Pro)'=>'Liiska su\'alaha aan la jawaabin (Pro)','Lists the questions visitors asked that the knowledge base could not answer.'=>'Waxay ku qortaa su\'aalaha ay booqdayaashu washeen kuwaas oo ay xog-ururintu aanay ka jawaabi karin.','Which gaps: open (default), drafted, answered, ignored or all.'=>'Daloolladee: furan (la bannaanshay), qabyo ah, laga jawaabay, la iska indhatiray ama dhammaan.','Draft help articles for unanswered questions (Pro)'=>'Qabyo qorista maqaallada caawimada ee su\'aalaha aan la jawaabin (Pro)','Writes draft knowledge-base articles answering the chosen questions (ids); they stay drafts.'=>'Waxay qortaa qabyo-qoraallada maqaallada saldhigga aqoonta ee ka jawaabaya su\'aalaha la xulay (ids); waxay ahaadaan qabyo-qoraallo.','IDs of the knowledge gaps to cover in one draft.'=>'IDs-ka farqiyada aqoonta ee lagu soo koobi doono hal qoraal.','Mark unanswered questions (Pro)'=>'Calaamadi su\'aalaha aan la jawaabin (Pro)','Marks unanswered questions as open, planned or dismissed (ids, status).'=>'Wuxuu su\'aalaha aan la jawaabin u calaamadiyaa kuwo furan, qorshaysan ama la diiday (aqoonsiyada, heerka).','IDs of the knowledge gaps.'=>'Aqoonsiyada daloollada aqoonta.','The new state of the gaps.'=>'Xaaladda cusub ee godadka.','Draft a help article from a ticket (Pro)'=>'Qabyo qoraal caawimaad ah oo laga keenay tigidh (Pro)','Writes a draft knowledge-base article from a solved ticket; it stays a draft until a person publishes it.'=>'Waxay qortaa qabyo-qoraal maqaalka saldhigga aqoonta ah oo laga soo qaatay tigidh la xalliyey; waxay sii ahaaneysaa qabyo ilaa qof uu daabaco.','ID of the solved ticket the article is drafted from.'=>'Aqoonsiga (ID) tigidhkii la xalliyay ee maqaalka laga soo diyaariyay.','Search the knowledge base (Pro)'=>'Raadi aqoonta saldhigga (Pro)','Finds help articles to link in a reply (q: the search).'=>'Waxaa la helaa maqaallo caawimaad ah oo lagu xiriiriyo jawaabta (q: raadinta).','Words to search the help articles for.'=>'Erayada laga raadinayo maqaallada caawinta.','Read support statistics (Pro)'=>'Akhriso tirakoobka taageero (Pro)','Returns chat and ticket numbers, response times and ratings for the last N days (days).'=>'Wuxuu soo celinayaa tirooyinka wada-sheekaysiga iyo tigidhada, waqtiyada jawaabta iyo qiimaynta ee N-kii maalmood ee la soo dhaafay (maalmo).','How many days back the report covers; 30 when omitted.'=>'Imisa maalmood oo hore ayuu warbixintu dabooshaa; 30 marka laga tago.','Draft a reply with AI (Pro)'=>'Ku qor jawaab adigoo isticmaalaya AI (Pro)','Drafts a reply to a chat or ticket from the site\'s content; nothing is sent.'=>'Waxay qabyo-qoraal uga diyaarisaa jawaabta wada-sheekaysiga ama tigidhadhka nuxurka goobta; waxba lama diro.','Summarise a conversation with AI (Pro)'=>'So koob wada-hadal lala yeeshay AI (Pro)','Summarises a chat or ticket in a few lines.'=>'Wuxuu soo koobayaa wada-sheekaysiga ama tigidhka dhowr sadar.','Change many tickets at once (Pro)'=>'Beddel tikidhada badan hal mar (Pro)','Changes the status, priority or assignee of up to 100 tickets (ids). Each ticket goes through the same checks as changing it on its own; the result lists each one.'=>'Wax ka beddelaya heerka, muhiimadda ama qofka loo xil saaray ilaa 100 tikidh (aqoonsiyada). Tikidh kasta wuxuu maraa isla hubinta sidii iyagoo gaar ah loo beddelayo; natiijadu waxay taxaysaa mid kasta.','Write a help article (Pro)'=>'Qor maqaal caawimaad ah (Pro)','Creates a knowledge-base article, or changes one (id): title, content, excerpt, categories and status (draft, or publish when you may publish).'=>'Waxay abuurtaa maqaal saldhigga aqoonta ah, ama ay wax ka beddeshaa mid (id): cinwaanka, waxa ku jira, soo-gaabinta, qaybaha iyo xaaladda (qabyo, ama daabac marka aad daabici karto).','Say what to change: status, priority or assignee_id.'=>'Sheeg waxa la beddelayo: xaaladda, mudnaanta ama assignee_id.','A new article needs a title.'=>'Maqaal cusub ayaa u baahan ciwaan.','Support agent'=>'Wakiilka taageerada','Invitation sent. The new agent sets a password from the email and lands in the Inbox.'=>'Casuma waxaa la diray. Wakiilka cusub waxa uu ka dejiyaa erayga sirta ah iimaylka waxa uuna soo caga dhigtaa Sanduuqa fariimaha soo gala.','Saved.'=>'La keydiyay.','Support agents answer chats and tickets and use saved replies. They cannot open any other part of wp-admin. Managers (administrators) also change settings.'=>'Wakiillada taageeradu waxay ka jawaabaan sheekooyinka iyo tigidhada waxayna isticmaalaan jawaabaha la kaydiyay. Ma furi karaan qayb kasta oo kale oo ka mid ah wp-admin. Maamulayaasha (maamulayaashu) sidoo kale waxay beddelaan habaynta.','Role'=>'Doorasho','Departments'=>'Waaxyaha','Manager'=>'Maamule','No departments yet (Settings, Team and routing).'=>'Weli ma jiraan waaxyo (Dejinta, Kooxda iyo hagidda).','Remove from the team'=>'Ka saar kooxda','Save departments'=>'Keydi waaxyaha','Invite an agent'=>'Casuum wakiil','If this person already has an account on the site, it is given the Support agent role instead (their other roles are kept).'=>'Haddii qofkani uu horay u lahaa koontada goobta, waxaa la siiyaa doorka wakiilka Taageerada halkii (doorkooda kale waa la hayaa).','Send invitation'=>'Dir casuumaadka','That account can already manage the help desk.'=>'Akoonkaas ayaa horay u maamuli kara xarunta caawinta.','That did not work. Please try again.'=>'Arrintaasi ma aanay shaqayn. Fadlan mar kale isku day.','You are not allowed to change the team.'=>'Looma oggola inaad beddesho kooxda.','Department'=>'Waaxda','— Choose —'=>'— Dooro —','Nothing to answer yet.'=>'Weli wax jawaab ah ma jiraan.','The AI could not draft a reply.'=>'AI-gu ma awoodin in ay qoraan jawaab.','The AI could not summarise this.'=>'Sirdoonka macmalka ah kari waayay inuu tan soo koobo.','The AI could not draft an article.'=>'AI-gu ma awoodin in ay qoraal soo saarto.','The AI answered in an unexpected shape. Please try again.'=>'Sirdoonka macmruka ah waxa uu ku jawaabay qaab aan la filayn. Fadlan mar kale isku day.','Saved replies'=>'Jawaabaha la keydiyay','A saved reply needs a title and some text.'=>'Jawaab la keydiyay waxay u baahan tahay cinwaan iyo xoogaa qoraal ah.','The sitemap could not be read.'=>'Khariidadda bogga lama akhriyi karin.','The page could not be read.'=>'Bogga lama akhriyi karin.','Very poor'=>'Aad u liidata','Poor'=>'Liidata','OK'=>'OK','Good'=>'Wanaagsan','Excellent'=>'Aad u wanaagsan','[#%1$d] How did we do? %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Sidee baan u qabannay? %2$s','We marked your request as solved. How happy are you with the help you got?'=>'Codsadkaaga waxaan u calaamadinnay mid xallisan. Sidee ugu faraxsan tahay caawinta aad heshay?','One click is enough. If something is still wrong, just reply to your request and it opens again.'=>'Hal gujiro waa ku filan yahay. Haddii wax weli khalad yihiin, kaliya u jawaab codsigaaga oo mar kale ayuu furmayaa.','This rating link is not valid any more. Thank you all the same.'=>'Xiriirkan qiimeyntu mar dambe ma shaqeynayo. Si kastaba ha ahaatee, waad mahadsan tahay.','Thank you. Your comment has been passed to the team.'=>'Mahadsanid. Faallooyinkaaga waxaa loo gudbiyay kooxda.','How happy are you with the help you got?'=>'Sidee ugu qanacsan tahay caawinta aad heshay?','Anything you would like to tell us? (optional)'=>'Waxaad rabtaa inaad noogu sheegto wax kale? (ikhtiyaari ah)','Thank you for your rating.'=>'Wadadsan qiimayntaada.','Back to the site'=>'Ku noqo goobta','The knowledge base is switched off.'=>'Saldhigga aqoonta waa la damiyay.','Knowledge gaps'=>'Fursadaha aqoonta','Nothing selected.'=>'Waxba lagama soo xulin.','%1$s We are back %2$s.'=>'%1$s Waanu soo laabannay %2$s.','First reply'=>'Jawaabta koowaad','Reply to this email to answer.'=>'Ku jawaab iimaylkan si aad u jawaabto.','Email from %s (not the customer on this ticket):'=>'Imayl ka yimid %s (oo aan ahayn macmiilka tigidhkan):','%d email read.'=>'%d iimayl waa la akhriyay.' . "\0" . '%d iimayl ayaa la akhriyay.','Import a knowledge base'=>'Soo dejiso saldhig aqoon','Import'=>'Soo dejinta','KB import'=>'So dejinta aqoonta','Last import: %1$d articles, %2$d categories. %3$s'=>'So dejintii ugu dambaysay: %1$d maqaallo, %2$d qaybood. %3$s','Finished.'=>'Waa la dhammeeyey.','Still running in the background: reload to see progress.'=>'Weli wuxuu ku socdaa xagga dambe: dib u rar si aad u aragto horumarka.','Copies articles and categories from another knowledge base on this site into the Zinn® Chat knowledge base, keeping the category tree, the order, the slugs and the content. Old addresses redirect to the new ones. Running it again updates instead of duplicating.'=>'Waxay ka guurisaa maqaallada iyo qaybaha kaydka aqoonta kale ee boggan una guurineysa kaydka aqoonta Zinn® Chat, iyada oo ilaalinaysa geedka qaybta, kala-sarraynta, slugs-ka iyo wax-ku-jiraa. Ciwaannadii hore waxay u sii toosinayaan kuwa cusub. Mar labaad oo la shaqsiiyo waxay cusbooneysiinaysaa halkii ay nuqul ka samayn lahayd.','Import from'=>'Ka soo dejiso ka','%1$s (%2$d articles)'=>'%1$s (%2$d maqaallo)','Another post type:'=>'Nooc kale oo qoraal ah:','with categories from'=>'oo ay ku jiraan qaybaha ka socda','(none)'=>'(mid ma jiro)','The pages under this page:'=>'Bogagga hoos yimaada boggan:','The originals'=>'Kuwa asalka ah','Set the imported originals to draft (their addresses then redirect to the new articles)'=>'U deji asalka la soo dhoofiyay qabyo ahaan (ciwaankooda ayaa markaas dib loogu hagaajinayaa maqaallada cusub)','You are not allowed to import.'=>'Lama ogola inaad soo dhoofiso.','yes or no'=>'haa ama maya','Knowledge base home'=>'Guriga saldhigga aqoonta','Heading (empty: the KB title)'=>'Madax (ee madhan: cinwaanka KB)','Only these categories (slugs or IDs, comma-separated)'=>'Kaliya qaybahaas (slugs ama ID-yada, oo ay kala soocaan hakadyo)','Leave out these categories'=>'Ka reeb qaybahaas','Columns, 1 to 4'=>'Khaanadaha, 1 ilaa 4','Articles under each category (0 for none)'=>'Maqaallada hoos yimaada qayb kasta (0 haddii aysan jirin)','Show article counts (%s)'=>'Tirada maqaallada muuji (%s)','Show the search box (%s)'=>'Muuji sanduuqa raadinta (%s)','Knowledge base search'=>'Raadinta saldhigga aqoonta','Placeholder text'=>'Qoraalka meel-bixiyaha','Search only this category (slug or ID)'=>'Raadi qaybtan oo keliya (slug ama ID)','Show results while typing (%s)'=>'Muuji natiijooyinka intaad qorayso (%s)','Knowledge base categories'=>'Qaybaha saldhigga aqoonta','Only these categories (slugs or IDs)'=>'Kaliya qaybahaas (slugs ama ID-yada)','Sub-categories of (slug or ID; empty: top level)'=>'Qaybaha hoose ee (slug ama ID; maran: heerka sare)','Articles under each category'=>'Maqaallada ku hoos jira qayb kasta','Show descriptions (%s)'=>'Tus sharraxaadaha (%s)','Order: order, name or count'=>'Dalabka: dalab, magac ama tirada','Hide empty categories (%s)'=>'Qari qaybaha madhan (%s)','Knowledge base category'=>'Qeybta aqoonta (Knowledge base category)','Category (slug or ID; empty: the category being viewed)'=>'Nooc (slug ama ID; madhan: nooca la eegayo)','Heading (empty: the category name)'=>'Cinwaan (maran: magaca qaybta)','How many articles (empty: all)'=>'Immisa qodob (madhan: dhammaan)','Order: order, title, date, modified or helpful'=>'Dalab: dalab, cinwaan, taariikh, la beddelay ama waxtar leh','Show summaries (%s)'=>'Muuji koobanayaasha (%s)','Show sub-categories (%s)'=>'Muuji qayb-hoosaadyada (%s)','Knowledge base articles'=>'Maqaallada aqoonta xarunta','From this category (slug or ID)'=>'Qaybtan (slug ama ID)','These articles (IDs, in this order)'=>'Maqaalladan (Aqoonsiyada, siday u kala horreeyaan)','How many'=>'Immisa','Order: date, modified, title, order or helpful'=>'Dalbo: taariikhda, wax laga beddelay, cinwaanka, dalbo ama waxtar leh','Layout: list or grid'=>'Habka: liiska ama shabagga','Grid columns, 1 to 4'=>'Tiirarka shaxda, 1 ilaa 4','Knowledge base article'=>'Maqaalka xog-ogaalka','Article ID or slug'=>'Aqoonsiga Maqaalka ama slug','Show the title (%s)'=>'Muuji cinwaanka (%s)','Knowledge base breadcrumbs'=>'Heesaha aqoonta (Knowledge base breadcrumbs)','No articles match.'=>'Ma jiraan maqaallo u dhigma.','See all results'=>'Arag dhammaan natiijooyinka','Search the help centre…'=>'Raadi xarunta caawinta…','Search'=>'Raadi','No categories yet.'=>'Weli ma jiraan qaybo.','%d article'=>'%d maqaal' . "\0" . '%d maqaallo','All %d articles'=>'Dhammaan %d maqaaladood','No articles in this category yet.'=>'Weli ma jiraan maqaallo ku jira qaybtan.','No articles yet.'=>'Ma jiraan wax maqaallo ah weli.','Breadcrumb'=>'Waddada Mareynta','Related articles'=>'Maqaallada la xiriira','Help centre'=>'Xarunta caawinta','Knowledge base'=>'Saldhigga aqoonta','Use the knowledge base'=>'Isticmaal xog-ururinta','Articles and categories under Zinn® Chat, Knowledge base.'=>'Maqaallada iyo qaybaha hoos yimaada Zinn® Chat, Kaydka aqoonta.','The KB lives at your site address followed by this, for example /kb/ or /help/.'=>'KB-ga wuxuu ku yaallaa cinwaankaaga mareegaha oo ay ku xigto tan, tusaale ahaan /kb/ ama /help/.','Title of the KB home page'=>'Ciwaanka bogga hoyga ee KB','Layout of the KB home and category pages'=>'Qaab-dhismeedka bogagga hoyga iyo qaybaha KB','Zinn® Chat layout: search, category cards and article lists'=>'Qaabka Zinn® Chat: raadinta, kaararka qaybaha iyo liisaska maqaallada','Your theme\'s archive pages'=>'Bogagga keydka ee mawduucaaga','Category columns'=>'Qaybaha tiirarka','Articles listed under each category on the KB home'=>'Maqaallada ku qoran qayb kasta oo ka tirsan bogga guriga KB','Show how many articles each category has'=>'Muuji inta maqal ee ay qayb kasta leedahay','Table of contents on long articles'=>'Miiska tusmada ee maqaallada dhaadheer','Ask "Was this article helpful?"'=>'Weydii "Maqaalkani ma caawiyay?"','"No" answers appear in the Knowledge gaps report.'=>'Jawaabaha "Maya" waxay ka dhex muuqdaan warbixinta doonyaha aqoonta.','Related articles under each article'=>'Maqaallada la xiriira ee hoos yimaada maqaal kasta','Structured data for search engines (Article and breadcrumbs)'=>'Xogta qaabaysan ee mashiinnada raadinta (Maqaalka iyo raad-raaca)','Left to your SEO plugin when Yoast, Rank Math, SEOPress or All in One SEO is active.'=>'Waxaa uga tagayaa qalabkaaga SEO-ga marka Yoast, Rank Math, SEOPress ama All in One SEO uu shaqeynayo.','Show "Help articles" search in the chat window'=>'Ka muuji raadinta "Maqaallada caawimada" daaqada wada-sheekaysiga','Suggest related articles under the assistant\'s answers'=>'So jeedi maqaallo la xiriira jawaabaha kaaliyaha hoostooda','Write richer articles with Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Ku qor maqaallo qani ah Page Builder Sandwich','Tabs, accordions, callouts and step lists right in the block editor. Every KB article and category page can use them.'=>'Tabs, accordions, callouts iyo step lists toos ugu jira block editor. Maqaal kasta oo KB ah iyo bog kasta oo qayb ah ayaa isticmaali kara.','Publish your KB in every language with Tranzly'=>'Ku daabaji KB-gaaga luqad kasta adigoo isticmaalaya Tranzly','Articles, categories, addresses and search results translated automatically, with each language on its own address.'=>'Maqaullada, qaybaha, ciwaannada iyo natiijooyinka raadinta ayaa si toos ah loo turjumay, iyadoo luqad kasta ay leedahay ciwaankeeda gaarka ah.','KB categories'=>'Qaybaha KB','KB category'=>'Qeybta KB','Add a KB category'=>'Ku dar qaybta KB','Edit KB category'=>'Wax ka beddel qaybta KB','Search KB categories'=>'Raadi qaybaha KB','Article'=>'Maqaal','Add article'=>'Ku dar maqaal','Add a new article'=>'Ku dar maqaal cusub','Edit article'=>'Wax ka beddel maqaalka','New article'=>'Maqaal cusub','View article'=>'Eeg maqaalka','Search articles'=>'Raadi maqaallo','No articles in the bin.'=>'Maqaallo kuma jiraan qashinka.','Search, categories and articles.'=>'Raadi, qaybaha iyo maqaallada.','One category and its articles.'=>'Hal qayb iyo maqaalladeeda.','Was this article helpful?'=>'Maqaalkani ma ahaa mid caawiyay?','On this page'=>'Bogganan','Article not helpful: %s'=>'Maqaalku ma caawinin: %s','Help articles'=>'Maqaallada caawimada','Search help articles…'=>'Raadi maqaallada caawimada…','Popular articles'=>'Maqaallada caanka ah','No articles match. Ask us in the chat instead.'=>'Ma jiraan maqaallo u dhigma. Halkaas waxaa ka beddelka ah, naga weydii sheekaysiga.','Browse the help centre'=>'Baadh xarunta caawimada','Back to the chat'=>'Ku noqo wadahalka','A draft is ready. Check it, fill in anything marked [FILL IN], and publish it: the assistant uses it at once.'=>'Qoraal-gacmeed ayaa diyaar ah. Hubi, buuxi wax kasta oo calaamadaysan [FILL IN], oo daabac: caawiyuhu wuxuu isticmaalaa isla markiiba.','Order'=>'Dalbo','Lower numbers come first.'=>'Tirooyinka hoose ayaa horreeya.','Icon'=>'Icon','A Dashicons name such as book, cart or admin-users, or one emoji.'=>'Magaca Dashicons sida book, cart ama admin-users, ama hal emoji.','New ticket #%1$d: %2$s (from %3$s)'=>'Tikidh cusub #%1$d: %2$s (laga soo bilaabo %3$s)','Customer replied on ticket #%1$d: %2$s'=>'Macmiilku wuxuu kaga jawaabay tigidhka #%1$d: %2$s','A visitor is waiting in chat #%1$d (%2$s)'=>'Booqasho-baxye ayaa ku sugaya wada-sheekaysiga #%1$d (%2$s)','Ticket #%1$d missed its first-reply target: %2$s'=>'Tikidh #%1$d wuu seegay yoolkiisa jawaabta koowaad: %2$s','Ticket #%1$d missed its resolution target: %2$s'=>'Tikidhada #%1$d waxay seegtay bartilmaameedkeeda xallinta: %2$s','Team and routing'=>'Kooxda iyo waddada','Hours and SLAs'=>'Saacadaha iyo SLAs','Email replies'=>'Jawaabaha iimeejka','Alerts and webhooks'=>'Digini iyo webhooks','Proactive messages'=>'Fariimaha hormuudka ah','Branding'=>'Calaamadaynta','One per line, for example: Sales. Agents are placed in departments on the Team screen.'=>'Midkiiba safkiiba, tusaale ahaan: Iibka. Wakiilada waxaa la geliyaa waaxyaha shaashadda Kooxda.','Let customers choose a department on the ticket form'=>'U oggolow macaamiisha inay doortaan waax foomka tigidhka','Assign new tickets'=>'U qoondee tigidhada cusub','Only agents in the ticket\'s department are chosen when it has one.'=>'Kaliya wakiilada ku jira waaxda tikidhada ayaa la doortaa marka uu leeyahay.','Do not assign (the first agent to reply takes it)'=>'Ha u qoondeyn (wakiilka ugu horreeya ee jawaaba ayaa qaadanaya)','In turn (round robin)'=>'Si beddel (wareegsan)','To the agent with the fewest open tickets'=>'Wakiilka leh tigidhada ugu yar ee furan','Use business hours'=>'Isticmaal saacadaha shaqada','Outside these hours "Talk to a person" is not offered, the chat says when you are back, and visitors can leave a message.'=>'Saacadahaas ka baxsan "La hadal qof" lama bixiyo, wada-sheekaysigu wuxuu sheegaa marka aad soo noqotid, booqdayaashuna waxay ka tagi karaan fariin.','Time zone'=>'Aagga waqtiga','For example Europe/London. Empty: the site\'s time zone.'=>'Tusaale ahaan Europe/London. Madhan: Aagga waqtiga ee bogga.','For example 09:00-17:00, or 09:00-12:30, 13:30-17:00. Empty: closed.'=>'Tusaale ahaan 09:00-17:00, ama 09:00-12:30, 13:30-17:00. Madhan: xiran.','Closed on these dates'=>'Waxaa xidhan taariikhahaan','One date per line, as YYYY-MM-DD.'=>'Hal taariikh saf walba, sida YYYY-MM-DD.','Track response and resolution targets (SLAs)'=>'La soco jawaabta iyo bartilmaameedyada xallinta (SLAs)','Tickets show how long is left, and the team is alerted when a target is missed.'=>'Tikidhadu waxay muujinayaan inta ka dhiman, kooxdana waa la ogeysiiyaa marka la seego bartilmaameedka.','Count only business hours toward the targets'=>'Xisaabi saacadaha shaqada oo keliya marka loo eegayo yoolalka','Let the AI set the priority of new tickets from their urgency'=>'Adoo ka duulaya degdegga ay leeyihiin, u oggolow garaadka macmalka ah (AI) inuu go\'aamiyo darajada muhiimada ee tikidhada cusub','First reply within (hours), %s'=>'Jawaabta ugu horreysa gudaha (saacadaha), %s','Solved within (hours), %s'=>'La xalliyay gudaha (saacadaha), %s','Customers reply to ticket emails'=>'Macaamiishu waxay uga jawaabaan iimayllada tigidhada','Their reply is added to the ticket, and the team is told.'=>'Jawaabtooda waxaa lagu darayaa tigidhka, kooxdana waa la ogeysiinayaa.','Off (they reply on the ticket page)'=>'Damisan (waxay kaga jawaabaan bogga tikidhada)','Read a mailbox (IMAP)'=>'Akhri sanduuqa boostada (IMAP)','An email service forwards messages to this site (webhook)'=>'Adeegga iimaylku waxa uu fariimaha u soo gudbiyaa bogan (webhook)','Support email address'=>'Cinwaanka iimeylka ee taageerada','Replies go to this address. It must be the mailbox read below, or the address your email service forwards.'=>'Jawaabuhu waxay ku socdaan ciwaankan. Waa inay ahaataa sanduuqa boostada ee hoos lagu aqriyo, ama ciwaanka ay adeeggaaga iimeylku soo gudbiyo.','Use plus addresses (support+123@…) so each reply finds its ticket'=>'Isticmaal ciwaanada lagu daray (support+123@…) si jawaab kastaa ay u hesho tigidhkeeda','Only if your mailbox accepts them; the ticket number in the subject works too.'=>'Kaliya haddii sanduuqaaga boostadu aqbalo; lambarka tigidhka ee mowduuca ku jira sidoo kale wuu shaqeeyaa.','Open a new ticket for other emails to the support address'=>'Furo tigidh cusub oo loogu talagalay iimayllada kale ee ku socda ciwaanka taageerada','IMAP server'=>'Imap server','For example imap.gmail.com.'=>'Tusaale ahaan imap.gmail.com.','IMAP port'=>'Dekadda IMAP','IMAP security'=>'Amniga IMAP','IMAP user name'=>'IMAP isticmaalaha magaca','IMAP password'=>'Erayga sirta ah ee IMAP','An app password where your provider offers one.'=>'Furaha abka halka bixiyahaagu uu mid bixiyo.','Send alerts for'=>'U dir digniinaha ku saabsan','New tickets'=>'Tikidhada cusub','Customer replies'=>'Jawaabaha macaamiisha','Visitors waiting in chat'=>'Booqadayaasha oo ku sugaaya sheekada','Missed SLA targets'=>'Yoolalka SLA ee la seegay','Push notifications to the agents\' phones and computers'=>'Ogeysiisyada riixitaanka ah u dir taleefannada iyo kombuyuutarrada wakiillada','Each agent turns them on in the Inbox, on each device.'=>'Wakiil kastaa wuxuu ka shiddaa Sanduuqa Fariimaha, qalab kasta.','Slack incoming webhook URL'=>'Slack URL-ka soo gelaya ee webhook','Microsoft Teams webhook URL'=>'Microsoft Teams webhook URL','Telegram bot token'=>'Token-ka bot-ka Telegram','Telegram chat ID'=>'Aqoonsiga sheeko ee Telegram','Webhook URLs (Zapier, Make, your own)'=>'URL-yada Webhook (Zapier, Make, kaaga)','One https:// address per line. Each event is sent as signed JSON.'=>'Hal cinwaan oo https:// ah halkii sadar. Dhacdo kasta waxaa loo diraa sida JSON saxiixan.','Webhook signing secret'=>'Qarsoodiga saxiixa Webhook','Empty: one is made for you. The X-Zinn-Chat-Signature header carries sha256= and the HMAC of the body.'=>'Waa madhan: mid ayaa laguu sameeyay. Madaxa X-Zinn-Chat-Signature wuxuu wataa sha256= iyo HMAC-ga jirka.','Rules'=>'Sharciyada','One per line: page | when | message. Page: * for every page, or part of the address such as /pricing. When: a number of seconds, exit (leaving the page) or 50% (scrolled half way). Example: /pricing | 20 | Questions about our plans? We are here.'=>'Mid kasta safarkiiba: bog | marka | fariin. Bogga: * bog kasta, ama qayb ka mid ah cinwaanka sida /pricing. Marka: tiro ilbiriqsiyo ah, ka bixitaan (ka tagista bogga) ama 50% (hore loo rogay kala bar). Tusaale: /pricing | 20 | Su\'aalo ku saabsan qorshayaasheenna? Waan joognaa.','Help desk name'=>'Magaca xarunta caawinta','Shown in wp-admin, on the agent app and on emails in place of Zinn® Chat.'=>'Waxaa lagu muujiyaa wp-admin, abka wakiilka iyo emayllada beddelka Zinn® Chat.','Logo URL'=>'URL-ka astaanta','An https:// image, for emails and the agent app.'=>'Sawir https:// ah, oo loogu talagalay iimayllada iyo abka wakiilka.','Email footer'=>'Iibaylka iimaylka','Tone'=>'Codka','Friendly'=>'Saaxiibtinimo','Professional'=>'Xirfadleh','Short and to the point'=>'Gaaban oo kooban','Playful'=>'Farxi leh','Persona'=>'Aqoonsiga qofka','Who the assistant is, for example: "Sam, who has worked in our bakery for ten years."'=>'Yaa uu yahay kaaliyuhu, tusaale ahaan: "Sam, oo ka shaqaynayey bakhaaraddayada toban sano."','Hand over to a person when a visitor writes'=>'U dhiib qof marka uu soo-boocleeyuhu qoro','Words or phrases, one per line, for example: refund, complaint, cancel my order.'=>'Erayo ama weedho, midkiiba hal saf, tusaale ahaan: celinta lacagta, cabashada, jooji dalabkayga.','Hand over at once when the assistant cannot answer and someone is online'=>'Gudbi isla markaana marka caawiyuhu uusan jawaabi karin oo qof uu khadka ku jiro','Tag, summarise and prioritise new tickets with AI'=>'Calaamadi, soo koobi, oona mudnaanta sii tikidhada cusub adiga oo isticmaalaya AI','Keep a list of the questions the assistant could not answer'=>'Hay liiska su\'aalaha uu caawiyuhu aanu ka jawaabi karin','Also read these pages and sitemaps'=>'Sidoo kale akhri bogaggan iyo khariidadaha bogagga','One address per line, on this site or another (a help centre, a documentation site). A sitemap adds every page in it. Re-read every day.'=>'Hal cinwaan halkii saf, bartakan ama mid kale (xarunta caawinta, barta dukumentiyada). Khariidadda sitemap waxay ku dartaa bog kasta oo ku jira. Dib u akhri maalin kasta.','Ask customers to rate the help they got when a ticket is solved'=>'Ka codso macaamiisha inay qiimeeyaan caawimada ay heleen marka tigidh la xaliyo','Webhook address for your email service (Postmark, Mailgun, SendGrid, Cloudflare Email Routing, or any service that can post the message as JSON):'=>'Cinwaanka Webhook ee adeeggaaga iimaylka (Postmark, Mailgun, SendGrid, Cloudflare Email Routing, ama adeeg kasta oo u soo diri kara fariinta sida JSON):','Keep it private: anyone with it could add replies. Save the settings with a new mode to change it.'=>'Sir ahow: qof kasta oo haysta wuxuu ku dari karaa jawaabo. Keydi habaynta oo wata hab cusub si aad u beddesho.','Last check: %1$s. %2$s'=>'Hubintii ugu dambeysay: %1$s. %2$s','Low'=>'Hoose','Normal'=>'Caadi','High'=>'Sare','Urgent'=>'Degdeg ah','Monday'=>'Isniin','Tuesday'=>'Talaado','Wednesday'=>'Arbaco','Thursday'=>'Khamiis','Friday'=>'Jimco','Saturday'=>'Sabti','Sunday'=>'Axad','Dismiss'=>'Ka tag','Push notifications are not available on this site.'=>'Ogeysiisyada riixitaanka lagama heli karo boggan.','%1$d waiting in chat · %2$d open tickets'=>'%1$d oo sugaya sheekada · %2$d tigidh oo furan','Answer chats and tickets.'=>'Ka jawaab wadahadalada iyo tigidhada.','Reports'=>'Warbixinaha','Show the chat'=>'Muuji sheekada','On every page'=>'Bog kasta','Only on the pages below'=>'Kaliya bogagga hoose ku xusan','Everywhere except the pages below'=>'Meel kasta oo aan ahayn bogagga hoose','Pages (IDs; 0 = the front page)'=>'Bogagga (Aqoonsiyada; 0 = bogga hore)','Post types'=>'Noocyada qoraalka','Hide from signed-in users'=>'Ka qari isticmaaleyaasha soo galay','Cloudflare Turnstile site key'=>'Furaha goobta Cloudflare Turnstile','Optional bot check on new chats and ticket forms.'=>'Hubinta bot-ka ikhtiyaariga ah ee wadahadallada cusub iyo foomamka tikidhada.','Cloudflare Turnstile secret key'=>'Fureheeda qarsoodiga ah ee Cloudflare Turnstile','%ds'=>'%ds','%dm'=>'%dm','%dh'=>'%dh','Agent'=>'Wakiilka','Internal note'=>'Xusuusin gudaha ah','With the assistant'=>'Kaalmada','Waiting for a person'=>'Sugaya qof','With an agent'=>'Wakiil leh','Left a message'=>'Farriin baa la reebay','Away'=>'Maqan','Focus mode'=>'Habka diiradda saaridda','Desktop alerts'=>'Ogeysiisyada desktop-ka','Needs a person'=>'Waxaa loo baahan yahay qof','Choose a chat on the left. You can open several; each keeps its own draft.'=>'Ka dooro sheeko dhinaca bidix ah. Waad furan kartaa dhowr; mid kastaaba waxay haysataa qabyo-qoraalkeeda.','A visitor is waiting'=>'Booqasho-baxayaal ayaa sugaya','Chat #%d'=>'Hadal-haynta #%d','Nothing here right now.'=>'Waxba ma yaallo halkan hadda.','Visitor #%d'=>'Booqde #%d','typing…'=>'qoraya…','waiting %s'=>'laga sugayaa %s','%d online'=>'%d online','Close tab'=>'Xir tabka','Back to the list'=>'Ku noqo liiska','Type a reply… (Enter to send, Shift+Enter for a new line)'=>'Qor jawaab… (Geli si aad u dirto, Shift+Geli si aad sadar cusub ugu bilowdo)','Ticket #%d'=>'Tigidh #%d','Take this chat'=>'Qaado sheekadan','Back to the assistant'=>'Ku noqo caawiyaha','Make a ticket'=>'Samee tigidh','The visitor\'s email address'=>'Ciwaanka iimaylka ee booqashada','The visitor is typing…'=>'Booqashada ayaa wax qoraysa...','New ticket'=>'Tikidh cusub','Search subject, email or number'=>'Raadi mawduuca, iimaylka ama lambarka','Customer'=>'Macaamiisha','Priority'=>'Mudnaanta','Needs attention'=>'Wuxuu u baahan yahay dareen','All'=>'Dhammaan','No tickets.'=>'Tikidhada ma jiraan.','Page %1$d of %2$d'=>'Bogga %1$d ee %2$d','Customer name'=>'Macaamiisha magaca','Customer email'=>'Iimaylka macaamiisha','Create ticket'=>'Samee tigidh','All tickets'=>'Dhammaan tigidhada','Write a reply…'=>'Qor jawaab…','Internal note (the customer does not see it)'=>'Qoraal gudaha ah (macaamiilku ma arko)','then: waiting for customer'=>'kadib: waxaa la sugayaa macaamiisha','then: solved'=>'markabkii: xalliyey','then: keep open'=>'kadib: furfuran hayso','#%1$d %2$s'=>'#%1$d %2$s','by email'=>'iimeyl ahaan','internal note'=>'qoraal gudaha ah','Channel'=>'Kanaalka','Nobody'=>'Qofna ma jiro','Assigned to'=>'Loo qoondeeyay','Order #%1$s · %2$s · %3$s'=>'Dalbo #%1$s · %2$s · %3$s','Delete ticket'=>'Tirtir tigidhka','Delete this ticket and all its messages?'=>'Ma tirtaa tikidhkan iyo dhammaan fariimahiisa?','Ask what your visitors ask. You see the answer and every page it found, with how well each matched, when it was last updated, and warnings for pages that look out of date. Fix a page, press Re-read, and ask again.'=>'Weydii waxa ay booqdayaashu weydiinayaan. Waxaad arkeysaa jawaabta iyo bog kasta oo ay heshay, adigoo eegaya sida ay mid walba u waafaqday, goorta la cusboonaysiiyay ugu dambaysay, iyo digniinaha bogagga u muuqda kuwo duugowday. Hagaaji bog, riix Dib-u-akhri, oo mar labaad weydiiso.','For example: What is your returns policy?'=>'Tusaale ahaan: Waa maxay siyaasaddaada soo celinta?','Ask'=>'Weydii','Not updated for over a year'=>'In aan la cusboonaysiin in ka badan hal sano','A newer page covers the same subject: %s'=>'Bog cusub ayaa ka hadlaysa mowduucan oo kale: %s','Re-read ✓'=>'Dib u akhriso ✓','Asking…'=>'Weydiinaya...','Outcome: %1$s · Search: %2$s · Tokens: %3$d in, %4$d out'=>'Natiijo: %1$s · Raadin: %2$s · Calaamado: %3$d gudaha, %4$d dibadda','by meaning and words'=>'macnaha iyo ereyada ahaan','by words only (no embedding key)'=>'erayada oo keliya (ma jiro furaha gelinta)','nothing indexed'=>'wax la index-gareeyay ma jiro','The AI is not set up yet or could not answer.'=>'Sirdoonka macmalka (AI) weli lama diyaarin ama ma awoodin inuu jawaabo.','Sources found (%d)'=>'Isha la helay (%d)','Nothing on the site matched. Add a page that answers this, or check the Site index settings.'=>'Waxba kama aysan dhigmin goobta. Ku dar bog ka jawaabaya tan, ama hubi goobta tusmada goobta.','Score'=>'Dhibcaha','Last updated'=>'Last updated','Passage'=>'Erayga sirta ah','Edit'=>'Wax ka beddel','Re-read'=>'Dib u akhri','What the assistant has read'=>'Waxa kaaliyaha uu akhriyey','%1$d pages read · %2$d waiting · %3$d with errors · %4$d passages · %5$d understood by meaning'=>'%1$d bogag la akhriyay · %2$d oo sugaya · %3$d oo cilladuhu wataan · %4$d qaybood · %5$d oo macnaha lagu fahmay','Embedding model: %s'=>'Qaabka la geliyo: %s','No embedding model: search is by words only. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to search by meaning.'=>'Ma jiro nooca embedding: raadinta waa erayo keliya. Ku xidh Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral ama OpenRouter si aad ugu raadiso macnaha.','Building meanings is paused:'=>'Dhisidda macnayaasha waa la h Joojiyay:','Re-read the whole site'=>'Dib u akhri degelka oo dhan','Rebuild all meanings'=>'Dib u dhis dhammaan macnayaasha','Filter by title or address'=>'Ku miir cinaan ama cinwaan','Read'=>'Akhriso','Waiting'=>'Sugayaa','Errors'=>'Khaladaad','Passages'=>'Qeybaha','by meaning'=>'macnaha ahaan','Rebuild meaning'=>'Dib u dhis macnaha','Done ✓'=>'Waa la dhammeeyay ✓','Failed'=>'Waa la waayay','%d second'=>'%d ilbiriqsi' . "\0" . '%d ilbiriqsi','%d minute'=>'%d daqiiqad' . "\0" . '%d daqiiqadood','%d hour'=>'%d saacad' . "\0" . '%d saacadood','%d day'=>'%d maalmood' . "\0" . '%d maalmood','This browser cannot receive push notifications here. On an iPhone, add the Inbox to your Home Screen first.'=>'Birawsarkani ma heli karo ogeysiisyada riixista halkan. iPhone, marka hore ku dar Inbox-ka Shaashaddaada Guriga.','Notifications are blocked for this site in the browser settings.'=>'Ogeysiisyada waa la xiray goobtan dejinta biraawsarka.','Notifications are on for this device.'=>'Ogeysiisyadu waa shaqeeyaan qalabkan.','Send a test notification'=>'Dir ogeysiis tijaabo ah','Sent. It should appear in a few seconds.'=>'La diray. Waxay soo muuqan doontaa dhowr ilbidhiqsi gudahood.','The push service did not accept it.'=>'Adeegga riixitaanku ma uusan aqbalin.','Could not turn notifications on.'=>'Waqtiyaha ogeysiinta lama shidi karin.','Phone app and notifications'=>'App-ka taleefanka iyo ogeysiisyada','Install this Inbox as an app: in Chrome or Edge choose Install in the address bar or menu; on an iPhone or iPad tap Share, then Add to Home Screen. It opens full screen, ready to answer.'=>'Sanduuqan Boostada ku rakib sidii abka: Chrome ama Edge ka dooro Ku rakib barka cinwaanka ama menu-ga; iPhone ama iPad-ka taabo Wadaag, dabadeed Ku dar Shaashadda Guriga. Wuxuu furmaa shaashad buuxda, oo diyaar u ah inuu jawaabo.','Turn on notifications on this device'=>'Daar ogeysiisyada qalabkan','Nothing found.'=>'Waxba lama helin.','Search saved replies'=>'Raadi jawaabaha la keydiyay','Link an article'=>'Ku xidh maqaal','Search the knowledge base'=>'Raadi saldhigga aqoonta','Suggest a reply'=>'So jeedi jawaab','Drafting…'=>'Waa la diyaarinayaa…','Replace what you have typed with the suggestion?'=>'Ma rabtaa inaad beddesho waxaad qortay adoo isticmaalaya talo-bixinta?','%s is writing a reply to this too.'=>'%s ayaa sidoo kale qoraya jawaabtan.','%s is also looking at this.'=>'%s sido kale wuxuu eegayaa tan.','No department'=>'Waax ma jiro','Tags, comma-separated'=>'Summadaha, oo lagu kala soocay commas','Tags'=>'Calaamadaha','Upset customer'=>'Macaamiil xanaaqsan','Unhappy customer'=>'Macmiil aan ku qanacsanayn','Summarise again'=>'Dib u soo koobi','Summarise'=>'So koobi','met'=>'la kulmay','missed'=>'lumin la dhaafay','overdue by %s'=>'waqtigiisu dhaafay %s','%s left'=>'%s ayaa haray','Customer rating: %d of 5'=>'Qiimaynta macaamiisha: %d ka mid ah 5','Write a KB article from this ticket'=>'Ka qor maqaal aqooneed tigidhkan','Write a help page from this ticket'=>'Ka qor bog caawinaad tigidhkan','Use them from the chat and ticket reply boxes (Saved replies), or type / and the shortcut, then a space. {name}, {first_name}, {agent}, {site} and {ticket} are filled in for you.'=>'Ka isticmaal sanduuqyada jawaabta ee wada-sheekaysiga iyo tikidhada (Jawaabaha la keydiyay), ama qor / iyo gaabiska, dabadeedna meel bannaan. {name}, {first_name}, {agent}, {site} iyo {ticket} waa laguu buuxin doonaa.','Shortcut (optional, e.g. refund)'=>'Gaaban (ikhtiyaari ah, tusaale ahaan celinta lacagta)','Text'=>'Qoraal','Every department'=>'Waax kasta','Save'=>'Keydso','Add saved reply'=>'Ku dar jawaabta la keydiyay